{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:27:11.120Z","ordinal":419239,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0dee9006881a09b045640cf93e4ab","status":"completed","call_id":"call_cc2b17b0d589442ea0689fc804abf1d6","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:18 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:27 UTC)\\n@@\\n-**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. On that exact head, JavaScript/TypeScript check run `40544627915`, CodeQL check [122332399521](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122332399521), and Node 22/24 jobs in run `40544627770` passed; the `linux-x86_64` package/test job in that same run remains in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. An independent review found and this checkpoint corrects the stale attribution that described the branch as updated only through `234c970`; final review of the corrected candidate, terminal Linux CI, and required merge gates remain pending. No merge is claimed.\\n+**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. On that exact head, JavaScript/TypeScript check run `40544627915`, CodeQL check [122332399521](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122332399521), and Node 22/24 jobs in run `40544627770` passed; the `linux-x86_64` package/test job in that same run remains in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. An independent review accepted the correction to stale branch attribution; final review of this checkpoint, terminal Linux CI, and required merge gates remain pending. No merge is claimed.\\n@@\\n-**Other release-path PRs:** PR [#276](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/276) records a synthetic-only qualification-host preflight (10/10) bound to `ceabfcc`; its Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass, while Linux packaging CI remains pending. Its evidence does not establish custodian access, held-out qualification, or acceptance. PR [#277](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/277) addresses configured Git-hook execution during checkpoint and retention operations. An independent read-only review of exact head `54d0f9f5be930a782f4a44abea15d015be6c4d3f` found a config-change race in per-hook suppression and silent success accounting after retention ref-deletion failures; findings were posted for the active implementation owner. CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, with Node 22/24 checks pending. Neither PR is merged.\\n+**Other release-path PRs:** PR [#276](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/276) records a synthetic-only qualification-host preflight (10/10) bound to `ceabfcc`; its Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass, while its Linux package/test CI is in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. Its evidence does not establish custodian access, held-out qualification, or acceptance. PR [#277](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/277) addresses configured Git-hook execution during checkpoint and retention operations. An independent read-only review of exact head `54d0f9f5be930a782f4a44abea15d015be6c4d3f` found a config-change race in per-hook suppression and silent success accounting after retention ref-deletion failures; findings were posted for the active implementation owner. Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks now pass; its Linux package/test job is in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. Neither PR is merged.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e33-4871-7821-919e-a68cb04742bc","create_time":1793122025.0032382}}}
