{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:37:41.977Z","ordinal":419627,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e33-4871-7821-919e-a68cb04742bc","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a039a152-36c6-40d2-8901-c93c70a305b2","process_id":"22076","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short --branch && git log -1 --oneline && rg -n 'human terminal acceptance|independent custodian|in progress|RC10 remains' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -10"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short --branch && git log -1 --oneline && rg -n 'human terminal acceptance|independent custodian|in progress|RC10 remains' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -10"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/rc10-readiness-20261027...origin/v1/rc10-readiness-20261027\n2cf9e994 docs(release): record readiness CI and review status\n11:**Other release-path PRs:** PR [#276](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/276) records a synthetic-only qualification-host preflight (10/10) bound to `ceabfcc`; its Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass, while Linux CI remains in progress. Its evidence does not establish custodian access, held-out qualification, or acceptance. PR [#277](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/277) addresses configured Git-hook execution during checkpoint and retention operations. Its exact diff received conflicting review dispositions: a GitHub review comment requested changes for a hook-discovery race and retention error accounting, while a separate read-only review returned ACCEPT. The findings remain unresolved pending the claimed implementation owner's response; no acceptance or merge is claimed. Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; Linux CI remains in progress.\n13:**Requirements and qualification:** A clean disposable snapshot of `origin/main@ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. The first requirements invocation on the documentation-dirty readiness worktree was correctly refused by its clean-worktree preflight and is not treated as a gate result. The existing [RC10 OpenRouter evidence bundle](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md) establishes a pinned provider verification and one passing synthetic small task; this does not establish the broader provider/standalone matrix. Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains an unaccepted prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` is listed. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open without independent custodian acceptance. T2/T3/T4, evaluator custody/host acceptance, remaining provider/standalone profiles, cross-runner exact-RC reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and scripted terminal gates remain incomplete.\n88:**Open convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) remains open remotely at `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on stale base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`; its old-head CI [40444141362](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40444141362) and CodeQL [40444141418](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40444141418) passed. A local rebase at `7de902390a9dc49586b3f26448961557ee11a063` on `14a9c15` has independent ACCEPT with unchanged diff SHA-256 `7fb392ce6d4e09e5e69649769a42ee2e994eb66581f65070106b034fc81ca7ad`; exact checks on that local head still require the owner to update the remote PR branch. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266) remote checks apply to its old head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` and base `2622663`. Its refreshed local candidate `bb20b9ea226984a3a3880f65c3cdef71ff81fbe2` on `14a9c15` resolves the independent Python import-binding findings, passes the focused tests 5/5 and CLI build, and has independent ACCEPT for diff SHA-256 `78637e6c71a0d2b96990d4f0678f04324590612cb8ff20a4ef7bedfd1a6680c6`. New exact-head CI requires an owner update to the remote branch. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267) remains open at `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on `14a9c15`, with independent scoped ACCEPT and focused provider-connect tests 37/37; CodeQL [40445472139](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472139) passed, Node 22/24 passed in CI [40445472051](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445472051), and Linux packaging remains in progress. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) still has its earlier checkpoint head `959f0c81bce316efaa4be750c7d6c2e75e7d8025`; its prior independent review requested an accurate record of PR #266's then-open findings. This checkpoint records the remediation and current review disposition. No PR #264, #266, #267, or #268 merge is claimed here.\n102:**Current convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264), head `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`, has independent ACCEPT; Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while its Linux package job remains in progress. It records scripted terminal evidence only and does not complete the manual terminal gate. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266), head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` on the same prior base, has Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passing; its Node 22 TUI test failure is being rerun, currently in progress. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267), head `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on current base `14a9c15`, carries the malformed credential-origin fix. Its exact two-file diff has independent ACCEPT (SHA-256 `2da500d09522bc059f63b07251953c552ac2270168c72d43920b181e44fd89d3`) and the focused provider connection suite passed 37/37 after rebase; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs are running and CodeQL passed. None of these PRs is integrated yet. PR #265 merged at `14a9c152`; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed. Its OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task, not full provider or standalone qualification.\n133:**PR #256 exact-head update:** Following independent source-review acceptance of candidate `987c73a8178390b0ed710474648ca1a71eaf060e`, the reviewed branch was pushed as a normal fast-forward from `c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a`. PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) now targets exact `origin/main` `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`; its hosted CI run [40347686120](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40347686120) and CodeQL [40347686125](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40347686125) are in progress. Do not merge until every required exact-head check completes successfully and branch protection/review requirements are satisfied. The 15:15 checkpoint immediately below remains accurate as a pre-push snapshot and is superseded for PR head and CI status by this update.\n149:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is bound to that exact commit: Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed; `linux-x86_64` remains in progress at `npm --prefix cli test`. Post-merge CodeQL run [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. The requirements-enforcement and version synchronization checks previously passed on exact `ff349383`; the version remains `1.0.0-rc.8`. Do not call source CI complete until the Linux job terminates successfully.\n255:**`agent.ts` handoff / PR #246:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) is open at head `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, still based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`. The slice has independent source-review ACCEPT and targeted build/tests passed, while its exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 suites remain in progress; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. At 01:54 UTC the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim was handed from `codex-root` to `KimiCode-defect-scan` with the branch and worktree recorded. The handoff requires waiting for the current checks to finish, merging current `origin/main` normally, and rerunning exact-head checks before integration.\n269:**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest comment is coordinator-authored at 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC, with no independent custodian acceptance or evaluator-compatible held-out corpus disposition. Held-out T2 has not started, and no private payload was accessed. Provider/standalone qualification and T3/T4 evidence remain incomplete. The five-environment by three-size manual terminal matrix remains 0/15, with no per-cell verdicts or required screenshots. The `cli/src/agent.ts` remediation handoff remains with KimiCode-defect-scan; implementation is still pending in that claimed lane.\n277:**Release state:** GitHub lists `v1.0.0-rc.6` as the latest published prerelease. Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` (tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824`) now points to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) is in progress. GitHub has not published an RC7 release or assets yet. RC6 is not an accepted RC, and no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n283:**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.