nstalled-RC acceptance. The validator report's `revision.dirty` field checks tracked files only; the generated evidence files were untracked outputs during the run.\\n+\\n+## Observed results\\n+\\n+- Evaluator account UID 985 is separate and has the `nologin` shell.\\n+- The restricted sudo rule permits the harness's Bubblewrap invocation and rejects the tested broader commands.\\n+- Bubblewrap 0.13.1 and `setfacl` are available.\\n+- `/srv/nexus-qual/ws` is an operator-owned 20 GiB tmpfs.\\n+- Resource enforcement and cleanup passed: memory max 16 GiB, swap max 0, process limit 4096, CPU quota 800000/100000, and one evaluator-owned survivor was reaped.\\n+- Operator-home and synthetic-store access were denied to the evaluator.\\n+- Qualification preflight failed closed without controls, and no run directories remained in the workspace root.\\n+\\n+The report binds the exact commit, resource profile digest, public manifest digest, and digests for all evaluator source files covered by the validator.\\ndiff --git a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/plan-10-host-preflight-ceabfcc-20261027/SHA256SUMS b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/plan-10-host-preflight-ceabfcc-20261027/SHA256SUMS\\nnew file mode 100644\\nindex 00000000..88cb5962\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/plan-10-host-preflight-ceabfcc-20261027/SHA256SUMS\\n@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@\\n+123103a04c65a4ded22658774b57a9451bf03372c234b9e5b3c9b5c40ed198da  README.md\\n+5de57f73d1073520da6f8b6599e08515614ee79d2d9f41578d1b61a4a8066a7e  runtime-identity.txt\\n+b6286d69696faf538b197ed0e26db9e005f61c05f5051235fc7f71546d99c02d  validate-ceabfcc-20261027T165220Z.json\\n+e867c52e0a5e5984b2fbbaaa2afd67cb84c33699b872982f9486340eb2f63e9b  validate-ceabfcc-20261027T165220Z.log\\ndiff --git a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/plan-10-host-preflight-ceabfcc-20261027/runtime-identity.txt b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/plan-10-host-preflight-ceabfcc-20261027/runtime-identity.txt\\nnew file mode 100644\\nindex 00000000..1e749655\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/d