{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:40:50.191Z","ordinal":419760,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-e83bf564-2a9d-4419-8dc2-89980dd86cea","process_id":"78774","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '145,162p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md && rg -n 'chatgpt.*model|provider verify.*chatgpt|ChatGPT sign-in|chatgpt-sign-in' docs/v1.0.0 docs/reviews/evidence -g '*.md' | head -80"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '145,162p' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md","name":"ACCEPTANCE.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'chatgpt.*model|provider verify.*chatgpt|ChatGPT sign-in|chatgpt-sign-in' docs/v1.0.0 docs/reviews/evidence -g '*.md'","query":"chatgpt.*model|provider verify.*chatgpt|ChatGPT sign-in|chatgpt-sign-in","path":"v1.0.0"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"| P-ollama | Emulated `/api/show` and Ollama overflow body | Same as P-llamacpp | Same, with the context source `ollama_show` |\n| Conformance | CI fixtures for llama.cpp, vLLM, LM Studio and Ollama shapes | CI | All pass (ACC-INF-01, -02, -05) |\n\nACC-INF-10 passes only when every row passes. The release notes state the scope in the form required by DEC-16.\n\n### 4.3 Provider matrix (E5)\n\n| Provider | Tier (DEC-06) | Required for v1.0.0 |\n|---|---|---|\n| OpenRouter, pinned model | Supported | `providers verify` PASS, plus one live small task (a §6-style bug fix) reaching a correct outcome |\n| ChatGPT sign-in | Experimental | Verify PASS recorded (already PASS at db1ca55; repeat on the RC) |\n| OpenAI API key, Anthropic | Experimental unless keys are added | If promoted: verify PASS plus one live task. Otherwise NOT RUN, and they are labelled experimental. |\n| Copilot | Experimental | Not required |\n\n## 5. Terminal acceptance (REQ-QUAL-108)\n\n### 5.1 CI PTY suites (E1)\n\ndocs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md:179:| REQ-PRV-111 | DEC-06 | Live `providers verify` for each provider listed as supported. The others are labelled experimental. | compatibility claims | `provider_cli.ts` | **RT 2026-10-14 @db1ca55:** chatgpt (gpt-6-luna) PASS, openrouter (openrouter/free) PASS. **RT 2026-10-16 @6151a23+4d82578, pinned models:** openrouter `nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free` PASS (one model served every request), chatgpt `gpt-6-luna` PASS (`evidence/live/verify_*_pinned_2026-10-16.json`). The run found and fixed the option-scope regression (4d82578). openai-key and anthropic not connected. | partial (repeat on the RC) | ACC-PRV-LIVE | RR | B §6 G2 | SPEC-05 / PLAN-10 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:112:**Inference environment.** All runs go through the homelab-ai gateway, which is the only inference path (owner, 2026-10-14). There is no direct worker access and no extra GPU. Every run, Nexus and peers alike, is serial on one gateway-backed model. Wall time is the critical-path cost (PLAN-10). Live cloud connections (ChatGPT sign-in, OpenRouter) may be used for small-spend checks, but are not used for matched comparisons. One reason: `openrouter/free` routed 3 requests to 3 different models in the 2026-10-14 verify run, which breaks model matching.\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:124:| **Experimental (always)** | ChatGPT sign-in (the owner's OpenAI OAuth connection), Copilot sign-in | They use unofficial OAuth flows with terms-of-service and stability risk. Opt-in with a visible warning. ChatGPT sign-in was live-verified on 2026-10-14 (`evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json`), and a live end-to-end run reached a correct VERIFIED (`evidence/live/run1_chatgpt_bugfix.log`). It is still labelled experimental because the sign-in flow is unofficial. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:248:| X4 | **Partly resolved 2026-10-14:** the existing ChatGPT sign-in and OpenRouter connections are authorized for small-spend checks; both were live-verified at db1ca55. Optional: add OpenAI API-key or Anthropic keys if those providers should be listed as supported. | DEC-06 | M5 (optional) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:295:**Qualification evidence and blockers:** The RC3 provider record `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.3/providers/e5-provider-verification-20261023.json` was independently accepted: ChatGPT sign-in streaming/tool round trip passed; OpenRouter failed authentication and its live task remains outstanding. Public Issue #1 remains open; its latest visible update is coordinator-authored at 10:23 UTC, with no custodian response. The sealed legacy `hidden.command` corpus is not accepted by the current `blackbox-v1` runner; no held-out qualification has started and no private payload was accessed. T2/T3/T4, long-task and fault-injection qualification, exact-candidate cross-runner reproducibility, all 15 human terminal cells, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:549:| `REQ-PRV-111` | partial | RC-pinned live provider verification is incomplete. Historical OpenRouter/ChatGPT evidence is not RC evidence; OpenRouter must use a pinned model. OpenAI API-key and Anthropic paths have no configured authorization. | Installed RC; available provider authorization | Provider qualification operator | On the RC, run `providers verify` for OpenRouter with a pinned model and complete one live small §6-style bug-fix task with a correct outcome. Repeat ChatGPT sign-in verification and retain PASS on the RC; keep ChatGPT, OpenAI API-key, and Anthropic experimental unless separately verified. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:600:- On the exact installed RC5 package, OpenRouter pinned model `nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free` and ChatGPT sign-in model `gpt-6-luna` each passed streamed completion and tool-call/result verification. No workspace content was involved. OpenRouter's required live small engineering task remains pending; the disposable synthetic task has a failing baseline and waits for the operator's folder-trust choice. Nexus remains in its default `review` approval mode; folder trust does not change approvals.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:83:| E5 | Cloud, small spend: ChatGPT sign-in (experimental tier) and OpenRouter with a pinned model; OpenAI and Anthropic keys if added | Provider verify; one live task per supported cloud provider |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:155:| ChatGPT sign-in | Experimental | Verify PASS recorded (already PASS at db1ca55; repeat on the RC) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md:25:| Runtime services | The local inference gateway is configured in `~/.config/nexus/config.env`: endpoint `https://10.0.8.5:8443/v1`, model `engineering/b0`, key redacted, `LOCAL_HARNESS_SHELL=bash`. The repo-tracked `cli/.env` holds LM Studio defaults (`localhost:1234`, key \"local\"). **The audit sent no requests to the gateway.** With owner authorization (2026-10-14, small spend), it made live cloud calls through the existing ChatGPT sign-in and OpenRouter connections: two `providers verify` runs and one `nexus run` bug-fix task. See EVIDENCE §3. | RT (values redacted) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/B_providers.md:92:| G1 No live evidence of standalone LM Studio / llama.cpp / vLLM / Ollama runs. `.nexus/inference_receipts.jsonl` (HISTORICAL, 2026-10-11..14) contains only provider-connection receipts: chatgpt 284 (281 completed), openrouter 12; local/appliance requests are never receipted (client.ts:561-569), so there is no machine-readable local evidence. | On a clean host with no `~/.config/nexus`, run each server with a small tool-capable model; `nexus run` a fixed 3-step edit task; capture `/status` context source, turn status, and transcript; repeat with the server's context set to 4096 to exercise PRV-06. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/B_providers.md:93:| G2 Live cloud qualification limited to openrouter + chatgpt (docs/reviews/NEXUS_CLOUD_PROVIDERS_LIVE_QUALIFICATION_2026-10-11.md, HISTORICAL). openai, anthropic, copilot, compatible: mock-only. | `nexus providers verify --provider {openai,anthropic,copilot,compatible} --model <m> -j` with operator keys; archive JSON. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":861596961}},"started_at_ms":1793122849329,"completed_at_ms":1793122850191}}
