{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T17:51:23.790Z","ordinal":420294,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0e49975a881a0983c023a009392c7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_d993e575a30a446f8cef6508c5736e30","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-chatgpt-verification-20261027 push -u origin v1/rc10-chatgpt-verification-20261027 && gh pr create --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --base main --head v1/rc10-chatgpt-verification-20261027 --title 'docs: record RC10 ChatGPT provider verification' --body-file - <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n- Record exact RC10 ChatGPT sign-in provider verification against the installed workflow artifact.\\n- Archive the three sanitized request receipts and bind them to the signed tag, source revision, and artifact SHA-256.\\n- Keep the disposition limited to provider verification; other RC10 acceptance gates remain open.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- Official installer and installed package provenance matched RC10 source revision and archive digest.\\n- Provider verifier passed streamed completion, tool call, and tool-result round trip (3 requests, bounded run).\\n- Evidence JSON parsed and `git diff --check` passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT for evidence SHA-256 `8fa49c2369f42f2f09707bc1f21a60f515501d30222939925731afc80bfec7cc`.\\n- No product test suite run; evidence-only change.\\n\\n## Remaining acceptance gates\\nThis PR does not establish standalone task correctness, held-out qualification, cross-runner reproducibility, manual terminal acceptance, or independent RC acceptance.\\nEOF\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:500}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793123481.461109}}}
