t】\nL58:   * 【42†clone】\nL59: \nL60: ### Basic Snapshotting\nL61: \nL62:   * 【43†add】\nL63:   * 【44†status】\nL64:   * 【45†diff】\nL65:   * 【46†commit】\nL66:   * 【47†notes】\nL67:   * 【48†restore】\nL68:   * 【49†reset】\nL69:   * 【50†rm】\nL70:   * 【51†mv】\nL71: \nL72: ### Branching and Merging\nL73: \nL74:   * 【52†branch】\nL75:   * 【53†checkout】\nL76:   * 【54†switch】\nL77:   * 【55†merge】\nL78:   * 【56†mergetool】\nL79:   * 【57†log】\nL80:   * 【58†stash】\nL81:   * 【59†tag】\nL82:   * 【60†worktree】\nL83: ### Sharing and Updating Projects\nL84: \nL85:   * 【61†fetch】\nL86:   * 【62†pull】\nL87:   * 【63†push】\nL88:   * 【64†remote】\nL89:   * 【65†submodule】\nL90: \nL91: ### Inspection and Comparison\nL92: \nL93:   * 【66†show】\nL94:   * 【57†log】\nL95:   * 【45†diff】\nL96:   * 【67†difftool】\nL97:   * 【68†range-diff】\nL98:   * 【69†shortlog】\nL99:   * 【70†describe】\nL100: \nL101: ### Patching\nL102: \nL103:   * 【71†apply】\nL104:   * 【72†cherry-pick】\nL105:   * 【45†diff】\nL106:   * 【73†rebase】\nL107:   * 【74†revert】\nL108: \nL109: ### Debugging\nL110: \nL111:   * 【75†bisect】\nL112:   * 【76†blame】\nL113:   * 【77†grep】\nL114: ### Email\nL115: \nL116:   * 【78†am】\nL117:   * 【71†apply】\nL118:   * 【79†imap-send】\nL119:   * 【80†format-patch】\nL120:   * 【81†send-email】\nL121:   * 【82†request-pull】\nL122: \nL123: ### External Systems\nL124: \nL125:   * 【83†svn】\nL126:   * 【84†fast-import】\nL127: \nL128: ### Server Admin\nL129: \nL130:   * 【85†daemon】\nL131:   * 【86†update-server-info】\nL132: ### Guides\nL133: \nL134:   * 【87†gitattributes】\nL135:   * 【88†Command-line interface conventions】\nL136:   * 【89†Everyday Git】\nL137:   * 【90†Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)】\nL138:   * 【91†Glossary】\nL139:   * 【92†Hooks】\nL140:   * 【93†gitignore】\nL141:   * 【94†gitmodules】\nL142:   * 【95†Revisions】\nL143:   * 【96†Submodules】\nL144:   * 【97†Tutorial】\nL145:   * 【98†Workflows】\nL146:   * 【99†All guides...】\nL147: \nL148: ### Administration\nL149: \nL150:   * 【100†clean】\nL151:   * 【101†gc】\nL152:   * 【102†fsck】\nL153:   * 【103†reflog】\nL154:   * 【104†filter-branch】\nL155:   * 【105†instaweb】\nL156:   * 【106†archive】\nL157:   * 【107†bundle】\nL158: ### Plumbing Commands\nL159: \nL160:   * 【108†cat-file】\nL161:   * 【109†check-ignore】\nL162:   * 【110†checkout-index】\nL163:   * 【111†commit-tree】\nL164:   * 【112†count-objects】\nL165:   * 【113†diff-index】\nL166:   * 【114†for-each-ref】\nL167:   * 【115†hash-object】\nL168:   * 【116†ls-files】\nL169:   * 【117†ls-tree】\nL170:   * 【118†merge-base】\nL171:   * 【119†read-tree】\nL172:   * 【120†rev-list】\nL173:   * 【121†rev-parse】\nL174:   * 【122†show-ref】\nL175:   * 【123†symbolic-ref】\nL176:   * 【124†update-index】\nL177:   * 【125†update-ref】\nL178:   * 【126†verify-pack】\nL179:   * 【127†write-tree】\nL180: \nL181: 【29†Version 2.55.0 ▾】 git-config last updated in 2.56.0\nL182: Changes in the git-config manual\nL183:   1. 【128†2.56.0 2026-09-28】\nL184:   2. 【129†2.55.0 2026-06-29】\nL185:   3. 【130†2.54.0 2026-04-20】\nL186:   4. 【131†2.53.0 2026-02-02】\nL187:   5. 【132†2.52.0 2025-11-17】\nL188:   6. 【133†2.51.2 2025-10-27】\nL189:   7. 【134†2.51.1 2025-10-15】\nL190:   8. 【135†2.51.0 2025-08-18】\nL191:   9. 2.50.1 no changes\nL192:   10. 【136†2.50.0 2025-06-16】\nL193:   11. 2.49.1 no changes\nL194:   12. 【137†2.49.0 2025-03-14】\nL195:   13. 2.48.2 no changes\nL196:   14. 【138†2.48.1 2025-01-13】\nL197:   15. 【139†2.48.0 2025-01-10】\nL198:   16. 2.47.3 no changes\nL199:   17. 【140†2.47.2 2024-11-26】\nL200:   18. 【141†2.47.1 2024-11-25】\nL201:   19. 【142†2.47.0 2024-10-06】\nL202:   20. 2.46.4 no changes\nL203:   21. 【143†2.46.3 2024-11-26】\nL204:   22. 【144†2.46.2 2024-09-23】\nL205:   23. 【145†2.46.1 2024-09-13】\nL206:   24. 【146†2.46.0 2024-07-29】\nL207:   25. 2.45.4 no changes\nL208:   26. 【147†2.45.3 2024-11-26】\nL209:   27. 2.45.1 → 2.45.2 no changes\nL210:   28. 【148†2.45.0 2024-04-29】\nL211:   29. 2.44.4 no changes\nL212:   30. 【149†2.44.3 2024-11-26】\nL213:   31. 2.44.1 → 2.44.2 no changes\nL214:   32. 【150†2.44.0 2024-02-23】\nL215:   33. 