{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:15:40.559Z","ordinal":421709,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17e93-3b0f-7881-81a8-bea6b209e48b","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for tracked diff SHA-256 `3783d16a0a7d335e127d42b518f1f2a43b36d259c9d66a2658bafb44a6408ee0` against base `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`. The supplied hash matches; `git diff --check` is clean. I did not run tests.\n\nThe 2.54 fail-closed gate is correctly conservative: Git 2.55 introduced `hook.<event>.enabled`, which disables all configured hooks for that event regardless of per-hook settings ([Git 2.55 release notes](https://github.com/git/git/blob/master/Documentation/RelNotes/2.55.0.adoc), [Git config documentation](https://git-scm.com/docs/git-config)). The expected-old deletion and create-only restoration also protect against overwriting a concurrent ref.\n\nTwo changes are needed:\n\n1. The new 2.54 refusal breaks manual pruning: [checkpoint.ts:376–393](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:376) deletes the checkpoint record before calling the guard, then swallows the guard’s error. On Git 2.54, pruning therefore loses the record while leaving its ref. Fail before unlinking, preserve the record, and report the failure; add an integration regression.\n\n2. The helper comment still says it appends `hook.<name>.enabled=false` at [git_hook_guard.ts:8–16](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/core/git_hook_guard.ts:8), but the implementation uses the event-wide `hook.<event>.enabled=false` key. Correct the description.\n\nAn untracked evidence directory is also present in the worktree; it is not included in the supplied tracked-diff hash and I did not review it."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793124940.559587}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":20422}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:15:46.744Z","ordinal":421710,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ea4dc85081a0b2cbee37d6598ce4","summary_text":["**Patching checkpoint prune errors**","**Implementing checkpoint pruning**"],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1793124941831,"completed_at_ms":1793124946744}}
