{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:19:11.863Z","ordinal":421919,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17e96-7476-7173-ab6a-92e0878b6c8e","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — reviewed the exact working diff, SHA-256 `24505962c5d887efe49b9499ef686f5fa2a0f7e29fd3aa0cd1c69de23f592073`, against base `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`.\n\nThe Git 2.54 guard fails before mutation; manual pruning now preflights it, deletes refs with an expected-old value, restores the ref if record deletion fails, and reports errors ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:377), [git_hook_guard.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/core/git_hook_guard.ts:24)). Retention performs confined identity validation before ref deletion and restores refs without overwriting concurrent refs if cleanup fails ([retention.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/core/retention.ts:1058), [retention.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027/cli/src/core/retention.ts:1116)).\n\nThe added regressions cover unsupported Git 2.54 pruning, record replacement during ref deletion, ref-deletion failure, and rollback. `git diff --check` is clean. I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125151.8628721}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":20427}}
