context only: it does not establish the checkpoint-choice gate, the five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix, or provider/task qualification.\n313:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 08:14 UTC at `1b9791f`; superseded above)\n317:**Source gates:** PR #159 (`a81f79df35a76207751ffd8a86640baafca98eeb`) merged as `1b9791f`. Its exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux package/reproducibility/install-smoke, and CodeQL checks passed; independent source review accepted the change. The focused Doctor schema-2 empty-history regression passed 1/1 with isolated HOME. At exact post-merge source `1b9791f`, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passes with all components at `1.0.0-rc.3`; `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passes with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. Post-merge CI run [39923089278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089278) and CodeQL run [39923089363](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089363) are running on the exact merge commit; do not claim post-merge CI complete until both terminate successfully.\n325:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 04:11 UTC at `1a484c3`; superseded above)\n327:**Authoritative release source:** `origin/main` is `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`, the PR #155 merge commit. PRs #153, #154, and #155 are merged. PR #153 integrated the checkpoint-choice flow; PR #154 refreshed readiness and the terminal worksheet; PR #155 fixed the remaining doctor integrity-scan timeout by batching metadata checks. PR #155 exact-head CI `39893335185`, CodeQL `39893335167`, and independent review passed on head `76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30`. Current-main CI run [39896372677](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39896372677) completed successfully on exact `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`: Node 24 at 03:56:55Z, Node 22 at 03:57:48Z, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility/package-smoke/installer-smoke at 04:11:34Z. Its Linux job validated identical package archives, checksums, notices, SBOM and installer across two builds. Current-main CodeQL run [39896372726](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39896372726) completed successfully at 03:43:55Z on that same SHA. CI’s Linux package used existing `1.0.0-rc.2` version metadata; it is source CI evidence, not an immutable RC3 artifact or qualification.\n329:**Source requirements gate:** At exact main `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in the isolated readiness worktree with isolated HOME/XDG. It reported 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, and 7 open; 12 rows remain mapped to exact-RC qualification. This is the pre-RC source gate only; it does not qualify an installed RC or change any acceptance threshold.\n343:**Authoritative release source:** `origin/main` was `fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285`, the merge of PR #152. PR #152 carried the readiness checkpoint refresh and terminal worksheet wording separating the §5.3 disposition gate from `ACC-TUI-MANUAL`; its exact head `deaf56fdb074df3f5cd3b62d50f811a2f14ca101` passed Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 package/repro/install-smoke CI in run `39881805268`; CodeQL `39881805274` passed. The independent reviewer accepted that exact head. Post-merge CI run `39885102002` passed Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility/smoke/install; post-merge CodeQL `39885101945` passed. These checks are bound to exact main `fa16045`. Retained post-merge check summary: [CI and CodeQL result](../reviews/evidence/v1/plan10-readiness-post152/post-merge-ci-main-fa16045.txt).\n347:**Source requirements gate:** At exact main `fa16045`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in a clean detached Git worktree with isolated HOME/XDG. Retained stdout is in the [exact-main enforcement record](../reviews/evidence/v1/plan10-readiness-post152/requirements-enforce-main-fa16045.txt). It reported 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, and 7 open; 12 rows are explicitly mapped to exact-RC qualification. This is the pre-RC source gate only. It does not qualify an installed RC or change any requirement's acceptance threshold.\n375:**Evaluator containment and Git isolation:** Source tests cover CPU, memory, process-count, storage limits, process cleanup, solution-bearing Git refs/reflogs/dangling objects, and external canary stores in `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`. PR #140 records a separate exact-source synthetic host preflight with 10/10 checks; its merge and CI do not establish held-out qualification. The public held-out manifest records 40 T2 tasks, ten each across four task classes and four languages; this metadata does not prove private digest re-derivation, author-session independence, effective access controls, custody acceptance, or qualification readiness. No private payloads or validators were accessed for this checkpoint.\n388:- The source requirements gate remains a clean-worktree pass on exact integration `7d6673f`; eleven requirements remain deferred to exact-RC qualification as listed in the checkpoint below. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; this CI progression does not establish RC readiness or acceptance.\n400:- **Exact-head CI:** PR #8 targets `main@db1ca55` from `v1/integration@7d6673f`. On current head, `javascript-typescript` runs [39624982585](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624982585) and [39624995598](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624995598) passed, as did CodeQL [119308898279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/119308898279). The required `test-matrix (20)`, `(22)`, and `(24)` jobs in run [39624995762](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624995762) were still pending at 15:26 UTC. The successful source workflow [39615105190] ran on parent `8f4504e`, so its results are not represented as exact-`7d6673f` results.\n427:The 2026-10-18 checkpoint sections below remain historical evidence. The previously closed PR #46 was never merged; its two readiness commits remain available on the preserved closed-PR branch, not in this reconciliation branch's history, and are superseded by this exact `8f4504e` update.\n445:- **Authoritative integration and CI:** `origin/v1/integration` is `4bce8760893b222789b76011a477dd61988ecba6`, merge commit for PR #44. PR #44 was merged from exact head `86b30f54b0fe087befbce8be258ae3bd3ff7cfa2` on base `faf95803714a3c543f5c59bc0610ca6291a6184d`; exact PR CI run `39141379739`, CodeQL run `39141379747`, and the `javascript-typescript` check passed. Independent read-only review accepted the only post-review delta. Post-merge CodeQL run `39144374432` passed on `4bce876`. Post-merge CI run `39144374445` is still running Node 20/22/24; its Cloudflare contract job passed. Exact integration CI on the parent `faf9580` passed as run `39139084949`, but it does not replace checks on `4bce876`.\n446:- **PR state:** PRs #9, #13, #15, #16, and #44 are integrated. PR #9's stale readiness changes were merged earlier and are retained in history. PR #33 remains open at `0ca77e5ee64f80db02e2b16178c5be551ce5de0c`, based on now-stale `faf9580`; its exact CI run `39141771002` passed all five jobs, including 1,243 CLI tests with zero failures, resource enforcement fixtures, staged Git-history/external-store canaries, security gates, deterministic package/SBOM comparison, and installer/package smoke. Independent review found a release-critical gap: preflight does not compare protected corpus paths with the evaluator's unconditional system mounts such as `/usr/local/lib`. The reviewer requested refusal of protected paths beneath every mounted host path and regression coverage. The evaluator claim remains active; no transfer or remediation checkpoint has been reported. Do not run held-out qualification. PR #33 must incorporate `4bce876`, fix this finding, pass exact-head checks, and receive independent re-review.\n447:- **Requirements enforcement:** `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` ran from a detached worktree at exact revision `4bce8760893b222789b76011a477dd61988ecba6` with isolated `HOME`; it failed as required. Ledger result: 123 rows (109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 11 below threshold: `REQ-AGT-002`, `REQ-AGT-010`, `REQ-PRV-003`, `REQ-REL-005`, `REQ-AGT-110`, `REQ-PRV-111`, `REQ-REL-114`, `REQ-QUAL-101`, `REQ-QUAL-107`, `REQ-QUAL-108`, `REQ-QUAL-109`. `REQ-AGT-118` remains tested. `REQ-AGT-010` remains partial; its existing ACC-TRUST-04 source evidence is pinned to `2c70d39`, and the current row still needs exact-revision evidence and a DEC-04-aligned disposition before promotion. The ledger owner was given this exact checker output; no ledger status was changed.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":671721690}},"started_at_ms":1793125415420,"completed_at_ms":1793125416092}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:23:37.116Z","ordinal":422177,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17e9a-809c-7930-9e26-3f059dbaf4b1","call_id":"call_22bf73da78a74eb28e1d25b7297c04d6","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## v1/rc10-readiness-20261027...origin/v1/rc10-readiness-20261027\n2cf9e9949dc6ff8068099d07d765919e59e538d3 2026-10-27T17:34:23+00:00 docs(release): record readiness CI and review status\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\nRefresh the release-readiness checkpoint against the current integration head. This is documentation only; it records exact source/CI status, open acceptance gates, and the existing source/RC/installed-RC/stable-release sequence. It does not change requirements, thresholds, or the acceptance disposition.\\n\\n## Exact revision and validation\\n- Base: `3b7af5d3cd46ab1b83e9c8df9862e09cee22b1a7` (`origin/main` at refresh).\\n- Head: `98f87bee6ca112e6d50f6fb2bc480fc47723c648`.\\n- Scope: `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md` only.\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT on the exact readiness update; diff SHA-256 `c8cf46163cd8be8666ea86e8a95a7483588e10aa3e8775fbfa213ce55895d41e`.\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: PASS (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; the 12 mapped RC-qualification rows remain deferred to exact-RC evidence).\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`: PASS.\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\\n- Exact-head PR CI is pending after this update. Current-main CI run `40521505143` was still running at the checkpoint; CodeQL `40521505001` passed on the exact base.\\n\\nAcceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. RC10 is a prerelease, no stable v1.0.0 release is claimed, and held-out custody, T2/T3/T4, provider/standalone, cross-runner, scripted and human terminal, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain open.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"2cf9e9949dc6ff8068099d07d765919e59e538d3\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"CLEAN\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[],\"title\":\"docs(release): refresh RC10 readiness checkpoint\"}\n1:# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n7:**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact remote head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. All exact-head checks passed: Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64` in CI run [40544627770](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40544627770), JavaScript/TypeScript in run `40544627915`, and CodeQL [122332399521](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122332399521). The earlier independent review found stale attribution; the local follow-up corrects it and records the completed Linux result. This corrected follow-up is not yet pushed or independently reviewed. No merge is claimed.\n13:**Requirements and qualification:** A clean disposable snapshot of `origin/main@ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. The first requirements invocation on the documentation-dirty readiness worktree was correctly refused by its clean-worktree preflight and is not treated as a gate result. The existing [RC10 OpenRouter evidence bundle](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md) establishes a pinned provider verification and one passing synthetic small task; this does not establish the broader provider/standalone matrix. Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains an unaccepted prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` is listed. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open without independent custodian acceptance. T2/T3/T4, evaluator custody/host acceptance, remaining provider/standalone profiles, cross-runner exact-RC reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and scripted terminal gates remain incomplete.\n24:**Readiness PR #268:** The owner refreshed PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) onto `main`; GitHub shows it open and mergeable at head `98f87bee6ca112e6d50f6fb2bc480fc47723c648`, based on `3b7af5d3cd46ab1b83e9c8df9862e09cee22b1a7`. Its Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass; Linux packaging/reproducibility run [40524245685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40524245685) is still pending. The 14:38 checkpoint update was independently accepted (diff SHA-256 `c8cf46163cd8be8666ea86e8a95a7483588e10aa3e8775fbfa213ce55895d41e`). The current local follow-up records terminal main and #269 CI plus the latest PR state; it has not been pushed, and no PR merge is claimed.\n66:**Current release PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) is open at `97e3f72e4a5fe8676a0a30ea9f6e023147ad73a5` on current base `d2442b0`; CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed and exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) is still running. PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on the previous `303ea32` source. Its earlier CI and CodeQL passed on that older head. A local readiness candidate has been refreshed to `d2442b0`; requirement enforcement (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), RC10 version synchronization, and diff hygiene pass on the refreshed candidate. Independent review asked that the old 05:54 snapshot be clearly superseded; this checkpoint does so. The refreshed candidate still needs final-base review, owner push, and exact-head hosted checks.\n119:**Current source and post-merge gates:** `origin/main` is `30f1b89a88bac81d8ab2d4f1e6800e1978a61f38`, the merge commit for PR #261. Its post-merge CI [40401857374](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40401857374) and CodeQL [40401857568](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40401857568) were still running at this checkpoint; do not call the new main source gate complete yet. PR #261's exact-head CI [40396216500](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40396216500) and CodeQL [40396216414](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40396216414) passed before merge. Independent read-only review ACCEPTed exact head `20170c51ef483319aadb56b6b3f60943d227816b`, diff SHA-256 `26a6761810c00cbd3c05b9e05bdbcb36c3e1e97c78693fa4cfed7293ae88fce3`. The PR's first attempt exposed a CI-only TTY-size assumption in its regression test; this was corrected by rendering a buffer directly through Crossterm and the corrected exact-head checks passed.\n166:**Acceptance and remaining gates:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; the latest public metadata-only custody request at 12:18 UTC has no custodian response. Private custody acceptance and evaluator-compatible sealed corpus readiness remain unestablished; no held-out payload was accessed or run. PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) remains open at c3bb2235, based on b73b6ec; it needs refresh onto ff349383 after remediation. Exact-head CI run [40338957629](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957629) failed on both Node 22 and Node 24 at `npm --prefix cli test`; CodeQL [40338957381](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957381) passed on the old candidate. This failure is on PR head c3bb2235 based on b73b6ec, not current main; refresh after remediation before using CI as evidence. A local, unpushed commit 8655ca87 fixes request-correlated local-setup cancellation (focused Node 34/34, Rust 4/4, build and diff checks passed), but the independent rereview recorded other unresolved credential/configuration findings; it is not integrated or accepted. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, exact-candidate reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no stable v1.0.0 release exists. Publication authority remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n182:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n192:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirms all components are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\n281:**Candidate changes:** PR #241 merged source/version preparation at `431cb194`, and signed RC7 tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` points to that exact source. PR #243 is refreshed onto exact base `431cb194` at head `a563eee0206d1287f5375a0ae113b1ca392fffd1`. Its CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; its exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 matrix jobs are running in CI run [40244800085](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40244800085). Independent source review accepted the exact candidate diff. PR #244 updates only this readiness document at head `0618fbc9d123043506f76eacf9753892cdd06963`; its CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 checks passed, while Linux packaging is running in [40243816407](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243816407). PR #245 updates four manifests/lockfiles for the completed Cloudflare experiment at head `13a955dbe156daec996fd97cfe6946024a3f0b48`; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 passed, and Linux packaging is running in [40244355480](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40244355480). An independent source review accepted PR #245's exact diff. No PR has been merged on the strength of checks from another commit.\n303:**Exact source gates:** `origin/main` and the signed `v1.0.0-rc.3` tag resolve to source commit `1b9791f07d301c885fe48f04a796203583ab5a5c`. Exact-main CI [39923089278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089278) and CodeQL [39923089363](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089363) completed successfully on that commit. CI passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux CLI tests, security gates, requirements checks, two-build package reproducibility, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.3` and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed at the same source; the latter reports 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. This is source-gate evidence, not product acceptance.\n307:**Installed-candidate and checkpoint-choice observation:** The published installer completed with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` and installed RC3 under `/home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.3`; installer provenance records the exact archive digest and source revision. `/home/mike/.local/bin/nexus --version` reports `1.0.0-rc.3 (1b9791f07d30)`. The previous RC1 directory remains installed at `/home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.1` for rollback. The coordinator reported an automated PTY probe of the installed default TUI using a synthetic Git workspace, fake credential-shaped canary, and unreachable loopback endpoint. The reported probe displayed the five choices and selected cancel before inference. Its transcript/capture was not retained in the release evidence tree, so this observation is unarchived and was not independently verified in the readiness review. It is diagnostic context only: it does not establish the checkpoint-choice gate, the five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix, or provider/task qualification.\n313:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 08:14 UTC at `1b9791f`; superseded above)\n317:**Source gates:** PR #159 (`a81f79df35a76207751ffd8a86640baafca98eeb`) merged as `1b9791f`. Its exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux package/reproducibility/install-smoke, and CodeQL checks passed; independent source review accepted the change. The focused Doctor schema-2 empty-history regression passed 1/1 with isolated HOME. At exact post-merge source `1b9791f`, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passes with all components at `1.0.0-rc.3`; `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passes with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. Post-merge CI run [39923089278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089278) and CodeQL run [39923089363](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089363) are running on the exact merge commit; do not claim post-merge CI complete until both terminate successfully.\n325:## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 04:11 UTC at `1a484c3`; superseded above)\n327:**Authoritative release source:** `origin/main` is `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`, the PR #155 merge commit. PRs #153, #154, and #155 are merged. PR #153 integrated the checkpoint-choice flow; PR #154 refreshed readiness and the terminal worksheet; PR #155 fixed the remaining doctor integrity-scan timeout by batching metadata checks. PR #155 exact-head CI `39893335185`, CodeQL `39893335167`, and independent review passed on head `76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30`. Current-main CI run [39896372677](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39896372677) completed successfully on exact `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`: Node 24 at 03:56:55Z, Node 22 at 03:57:48Z, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility/package-smoke/installer-smoke at 04:11:34Z. Its Linux job validated identical package archives, checksums, notices, SBOM and installer across two builds. Current-main CodeQL run [39896372726](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39896372726) completed successfully at 03:43:55Z on that same SHA. CI’s Linux package used existing `1.0.0-rc.2` version metadata; it is source CI evidence, not an immutable RC3 artifact or qualification.\n329:**Source requirements gate:** At exact main `1a484c38518688005e9434b18c889c77b408e145`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in the isolated readiness worktree with isolated HOME/XDG. It reported 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, and 7 open; 12 rows remain mapped to exact-RC qualification. This is the pre-RC source gate only; it does not qualify an installed RC or change any acceptance threshold.\n343:**Authoritative release source:** `origin/main` was `fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285`, the merge of PR #152. PR #152 carried the readiness checkpoint refresh and terminal worksheet wording separating the §5.3 disposition gate from `ACC-TUI-MANUAL`; its exact head `deaf56fdb074df3f5cd3b62d50f811a2f14ca101` passed Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 package/repro/install-smoke CI in run `39881805268`; CodeQL `39881805274` passed. The independent reviewer accepted that exact head. Post-merge CI run `39885102002` passed Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility/smoke/install; post-merge CodeQL `39885101945` passed. These checks are bound to exact main `fa16045`. Retained post-merge check summary: [CI and CodeQL result](../reviews/evidence/v1/plan10-readiness-post152/post-merge-ci-main-fa16045.txt).\n347:**Source requirements gate:** At exact main `fa16045`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in a clean detached Git worktree with isolated HOME/XDG. Retained stdout is in the [exact-main enforcement record](../reviews/evidence/v1/plan10-readiness-post152/requirements-enforce-main-fa16045.txt). It reported 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, and 7 open; 12 rows are explicitly mapped to exact-RC qualification. This is the pre-RC source gate only. It does not qualify an installed RC or change any requirement's acceptance threshold.\n375:**Evaluator containment and Git isolation:** Source tests cover CPU, memory, process-count, storage limits, process cleanup, solution-bearing Git refs/reflogs/dangling objects, and external canary stores in `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`. PR #140 records a separate exact-source synthetic host preflight with 10/10 checks; its merge and CI do not establish held-out qualification. The public held-out manifest records 40 T2 tasks, ten each across four task classes and four languages; this metadata does not prove private digest re-derivation, author-session independence, effective access controls, custody acceptance, or qualification readiness. No private payloads or validators were accessed for this checkpoint.\n388:- The source requirements gate remains a clean-worktree pass on exact integration `7d6673f`; eleven requirements remain deferred to exact-RC qualification as listed in the checkpoint below. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; this CI progression does not establish RC readiness or acceptance.\n400:- **Exact-head CI:** PR #8 targets `main@db1ca55` from `v1/integration@7d6673f`. On current head, `javascript-typescript` runs [39624982585](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624982585) and [39624995598](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624995598) passed, as did CodeQL [119308898279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/119308898279). The required `test-matrix (20)`, `(22)`, and `(24)` jobs in run [39624995762](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39624995762) were still pending at 15:26 UTC. The successful source workflow [39615105190] ran on parent `8f4504e`, so its results are not represented as exact-`7d6673f` results.\n427:The 2026-10-18 checkpoint sections below remain historical evidence. The previously closed PR #46 was never merged; its two readiness commits remain available on the preserved closed-PR branch, not in this reconciliation branch's history, and are superseded by this exact `8f4504e` update.\n445:- **Authoritative integration and CI:** `origin/v1/integration` is `4bce8760893b222789b76011a477dd61988ecba6`, merge commit for PR #44. PR #44 was merged from exact head `86b30f54b0fe087befbce8be258ae3bd3ff7cfa2` on base `faf95803714a3c543f5c59bc0610ca6291a6184d`; exact PR CI run `39141379739`, CodeQL run `39141379747`, and the `javascript-typescript` check passed. Independent read-only review accepted the only post-review delta. Post-merge CodeQL run `39144374432` passed on `4bce876`. Post-merge CI run `39144374445` is still running Node 20/22/24; its Cloudflare contract job passed. Exact integration CI on the parent `faf9580` passed as run `39139084949`, but it does not replace checks on `4bce876`.\n446:- **PR state:** PRs #9, #13, #15, #16, and #44 are integrated. PR #9's stale readiness changes were merged earlier and are retained in history. PR #33 remains open at `0ca77e5ee64f80db02e2b16178c5be551ce5de0c`, based on now-stale `faf9580`; its exact CI run `39141771002` passed all five jobs, including 1,243 CLI tests with zero failures, resource enforcement fixtures, staged Git-history/external-store canaries, security gates, deterministic package/SBOM comparison, and installer/package smoke. Independent review found a release-critical gap: preflight does not compare protected corpus paths with the evaluator's unconditional system mounts such as `/usr/local/lib`. The reviewer requested refusal of protected paths beneath every mounted host path and regression coverage. The evaluator claim remains active; no transfer or remediation checkpoint has been reported. Do not run held-out qualification. PR #33 must incorporate `4bce876`, fix this finding, pass exact-head checks, and receive independent re-review.\n447:- **Requirements enforcement:** `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` ran from a detached worktree at exact revision `4bce8760893b222789b76011a477dd61988ecba6` with isolated `HOME`; it failed as required. Ledger result: 123 rows (109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 11 below threshold: `REQ-AGT-002`, `REQ-AGT-010`, `REQ-PRV-003`, `REQ-REL-005`, `REQ-AGT-110`, `REQ-PRV-111`, `REQ-REL-114`, `REQ-QUAL-101`, `REQ-QUAL-107`, `REQ-QUAL-108`, `REQ-QUAL-109`. `REQ-AGT-118` remains tested. `REQ-AGT-010` remains partial; its existing ACC-TRUST-04 source evidence is pinned to `2c70d39`, and the current row still needs exact-revision evidence and a DEC-04-aligned disposition before promotion. The ledger owner was given this exact checker output; no ledger status was changed.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125417.1165223}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
