{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:26:13.716Z","ordinal":422306,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8102ead2-38e6-4553-9f64-1c1a7fb3c688","process_id":"23354","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","xerj def \"validateDownloadUrl\" --prefix nexus-cli --full"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"xerj def \"validateDownloadUrl\" --prefix nexus-cli --full"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"xerj def: unexpected argument '--full'\n\nxerj def — find where a symbol is defined (go-to-definition, no scripts)\nDefault ranking is lexical: it matches the words you typed, and it is not a neural reading of the code.\n\nUSAGE:\n    xerj def [OPTIONS] \"<symbol or capability>\"\n\nOPTIONS:\n    --url <U>       node endpoint (default $XERJ_URL or http://localhost:9200)\n    --prefix <P>    index prefix to search (default \"ax\" — what `xerj autoindex` writes)\n    --api-key <K>   Authorization (or $XERJ_API_KEY; --insecure nodes need none)\n    -k <N>          number of definitions to return (default 5)\n    --kind <KIND>   filter by symbol kind (function, class, method, ...)\n    --lang <LANG>   filter by language (python, rust, typescript, ...)\n    --json          print the raw response instead of formatted definitions\n\nEXAMPLE:\n    xerj def IOSIntfLine                       # exact identifier -> its declaration\n    xerj def \"euler angles to rotation matrix\"  # plain words also resolve the definer\n\nSEE ALSO:\n    xerj search \"<plain words>\"    ranked passages when you don't know the name\n\n","exit_code":2,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":728281838}},"started_at_ms":1793125572988,"completed_at_ms":1793125573716}}
