{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:28:01.143Z","ordinal":422370,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ed30601481a085d8f15242bed20b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The independent reviewer found three wording inaccuracies in my readiness update: GitHub does not currently block PR #268 from merging, the terminal-cell unavailability should be recorded without over-attributing it to public evidence, and stable publication wording should preserve the G6 gate. I’m correcting those before I commit or push the refreshed readiness change."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793125680460,"completed_at_ms":1793125681143}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:28:01.147Z","ordinal":422371,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ed30601481a085d8f15242bed20b","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The independent reviewer found three wording inaccuracies in my readiness update: GitHub does not currently block PR #268 from merging, the terminal-cell unavailability should be recorded without over-attributing it to public evidence, and stable publication wording should preserve the G6 gate. I’m correcting those before I commit or push the refreshed readiness change.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125680.405946,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ed30601481a085d8f15242bed20b","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17e9e-87fb-7881-bb25-dea05546b6ce","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":20444}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:28:05.005Z","ordinal":422372,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ed31186c81a0a439f40ede73b697","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7d58f1f53155426098690d96870dd1da","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-**Readiness PR #268:** The remote PR remains open at head `2cf9e9949dc6ff8068099d07d765919e59e538d3`, based on `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. Its exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed on that older base. GitHub reports no independent review on the current PR head and blocks merging. This readiness branch has been brought forward to include `origin/main@7a860c0`; this checkpoint records the exact old PR evidence and the current base separately. The refreshed change still requires independent review and exact-head CI.\\n+**Readiness PR #268:** The remote PR remains open at head `2cf9e9949dc6ff8068099d07d765919e59e538d3`, based on `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. Its exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed on that older base. GitHub reports no review on the current PR head and currently marks it mergeable; those checks do not cover current `main@7a860c0`. This readiness branch has been brought forward to include `origin/main@7a860c0`; its refreshed change requires independent review and exact-head CI before its evidence can be relied on for current main.\\n@@\\n-**Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; the operator cannot run the requested xterm 80×24 cell now, and no result or screenshot is inferred. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication is authorized but gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\\n+**Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125681.096875}}}
