{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:31:12.959Z","ordinal":422509,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0edeb6a0081a0b7f9c24d853df912","status":"completed","call_id":"call_39007372275b4e83a23a6629c22b780f","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:30 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:31 UTC)\\n@@\\n-**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`, integrating PR #277. Post-merge CI run [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) is still in progress; CodeQL run [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202502) passed on the exact same SHA. A clean detached worktree at `7a860c0` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\\n+**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`, integrating PR #277. Post-merge CI run [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) and CodeQL run [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202502) both passed on that exact SHA; CI passed Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64`. A clean detached worktree at `7a860c0` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\\n@@\\n-**Readiness PR #268:** At the 18:30 UTC observation, the PR was at head `e17a4519c5eb7834cf1dc58f73bfeac9f0985a0c` on current base `main@7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`. Exact-head CI and CodeQL were in progress; Node 22, Node 24, and JavaScript/TypeScript were running. No independent review was recorded for that head. Its prior head `2cf9e99` passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks against the older `ceabfcc` base; those results do not qualify the refreshed head. This checkpoint update advances the PR again, so its resulting head requires its own exact-head CI and independent review before merge.\\n+**Readiness PR #268:** At the 18:31 UTC observation, the PR was at head `e17a4519c5eb7834cf1dc58f73bfeac9f0985a0c` on current base `main@7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`. Node 22 and Node 24 were still running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL had passed. No independent review was recorded for that head. Its prior head `2cf9e99` passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks against the older `ceabfcc` base; those results do not qualify the refreshed head. This checkpoint update advances the PR again, so its resulting head requires its own exact-head CI and independent review before merge.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125867.4178634}}}
