{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:32:05.128Z","ordinal":422549,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-9af6b29c-bc0c-40ca-9ca2-e9beb3248497","process_id":"7827","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md && git status --short"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md && git status --short"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex 01391769..f1c1d120 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,12 +1,12 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:31 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:32 UTC)\n \n **Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`, integrating PR #277. Post-merge CI run [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) and CodeQL run [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202502) both passed on that exact SHA; CI passed Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64`. A clean detached worktree at `7a860c0` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\n \n-**Readiness PR #268:** At the 18:31 UTC observation, the PR was at head `e17a4519c5eb7834cf1dc58f73bfeac9f0985a0c` on current base `main@7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`. Node 22 and Node 24 were still running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL had passed. No independent review was recorded for that head. Its prior head `2cf9e99` passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks against the older `ceabfcc` base; those results do not qualify the refreshed head. This checkpoint update advances the PR again, so its resulting head requires its own exact-head CI and independent review before merge.\n+**Readiness PR #268:** At the 18:32 UTC observation, the PR was at head `e17a4519c5eb7834cf1dc58f73bfeac9f0985a0c` on current base `main@7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`. Node 22 and Node 24 were still running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL had passed. No independent review was recorded for that head. Its prior head `2cf9e99` passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks against the older `ceabfcc` base; those results do not qualify the refreshed head. This checkpoint update advances the PR again, so its resulting head requires its own exact-head CI and independent review before merge.\n \n-**Other open source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) fixes configured-hook race and retention error handling. Its exact diff was independently accepted; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, while Node 22 and Node 24 are pending. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) records RC10 ChatGPT verification; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 pass, while Linux packaging remains pending. Neither PR is merged.\n+**Other open source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) addresses the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by merged PR #277. Owner read-only review accepted exact head `a27b0d7c6d2195fb805eb88540a0f4a130b7a888` (diff SHA-256 `8e3eb6ea729c8c06f11d9915c1668a288a455802b0dc161c701787039d72853b`); Node 22/24 are running, while CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass. Until this corrective PR merges, the findings remain present on main. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) records RC10 ChatGPT verification; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 pass, while Linux packaging remains in progress. Neither PR is merged.\n \n **Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\n \n M docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":716159208}},"started_at_ms":1793125924411,"completed_at_ms":1793125925128}}
