stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\n \n M docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793125926.492262}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
