{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:35:51.481Z","ordinal":422708,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ef06c7f081a0ab3115cc4919acde","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR #278 is merged as `cf05322`, adding the independently reviewed RC10 ChatGPT verification record. Its checks passed; the new main CI and CodeQL runs have started on the merge commit. I’ve also merged that exact main into the readiness worktree and rerun the source requirements and RC10 version checks there. I’m updating the checkpoint before its next push."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793126150838,"completed_at_ms":1793126151481}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:35:51.488Z","ordinal":422709,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ef06c7f081a0ab3115cc4919acde","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"PR #278 is merged as `cf05322`, adding the independently reviewed RC10 ChatGPT verification record. Its checks passed; the new main CI and CodeQL runs have started on the merge commit. I’ve also merged that exact main into the readiness worktree and rerun the source requirements and RC10 version checks there. I’m updating the checkpoint before its next push.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793126150.7837055,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ef06c7f081a0ab3115cc4919acde","turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17ea5-b540-7d32-b5aa-fa4adf84a7ab","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":20469}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:35:58.778Z","ordinal":422710,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0ef076d5c81a092bdf4aed245179d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1fea5e56eaa346449f2ddd6a67c8917c","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:33 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:36 UTC)\\n@@\\n-**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a`, integrating PR #277. Post-merge CI run [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) and CodeQL run [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202502) both passed on that exact SHA; CI passed Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64`. A clean detached worktree at `7a860c0` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\\n+**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `cf05322cc0368af900b2fb425852daa2d0de403e`, merging PR #278 after PR #277. Post-merge CI [40561348972](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348972) and CodeQL [40561348985](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348985) are in progress on that exact SHA. Earlier exact-main CI [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) and CodeQL [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202502) passed on parent `7a860c0`. A clean detached worktree at `cf05322` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\\n@@\\n-**Readiness PR #268:** The first refresh commit `e17a451` was on current base `main@7a860c0`; its observation recorded Node 22/24 in progress and JavaScript/TypeScript plus CodeQL passed. The current remote PR head is `9b9c1813207b228e695e91f727af1fae3b9cc5fa` on that same base. At 18:33 UTC, CodeQL passed while JavaScript/TypeScript and Node 22/24 were pending; no independent review was recorded on `9b9c181`. The older `2cf9e99` checks passed against `ceabfcc`, but do not qualify the refreshed branch. The next checkpoint commit will advance the PR head again and require its own exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\\n+**Readiness PR #268:** At 18:36 UTC, GitHub reported the remote PR at head `09240beb679c8b593b429c4e6d241af5d975104f`, with Node 22/24 CI still in progress and CodeQL passed; no independent review was recorded. Its check run and reported base were from before `cf05322` merged. This readiness branch now includes `origin/main@cf05322`; the current checkpoint update will advance its PR head again, so its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\\n@@\\n-**Other open source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) addresses the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by merged PR #277. An independent read-only review accepted exact head `a27b0d7c6d2195fb805eb88540a0f4a130b7a888`; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, while Node 22 and Node 24 are pending. Until this corrective PR merges, the findings remain present on main. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) records RC10 ChatGPT verification; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Linux, Node 22, and Node 24 pass. Neither PR is merged.\\n+**Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) addresses the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by merged PR #277. An independent read-only review accepted exact head `a27b0d7c6d2195fb805eb88540a0f4a130b7a888`; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, while Node 22 and Node 24 are pending. Until this corrective PR merges, the findings remain present on main. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; all required exact-head checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. Its provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only; it does not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17e71-922f-7ef3-a2c1-bcdcbd1f8423","create_time":1793126151.4285185}}}
