ource PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) addresses the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by merged PR #277. An independent read-only review accepted exact head `a27b0d7c6d2195fb805eb88540a0f4a130b7a888`; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, while Node 22 and Node 24 are pending. Until this corrective PR merges, the findings remain present on main. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; all required exact-head checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. Its provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only; it does not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793126158851,"completed_at_ms":1793126158854}}
