accurate, and invalid connected-provider URLs must not fail the entire catalog. The owner reacquired the relevant claims and is implementing regressions; no fixes are yet accepted on the refreshed branch.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN with no custodian response to the latest metadata-only request (12:18 UTC). Private custody, evaluator-compatible corpus sealing, and held-out acceptance remain unestablished. No held-out payload was accessed or run. Exact-current-RC provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, cross-runner and independent acceptance are not established. The human terminal matrix remains **0/15**. RC8 remains an older prerelease, not a current-source candidate; stable v1.0.0 is unpublished. Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authority remains granted but gated.\n\nThe 14:35 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its current-main CI progress and PR #256 candidate/review status.\n\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 14:35 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** origin/main is ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4, the merge commit for PR #255. PR #255's exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is still running Node 22/24 on ff349383; post-merge CodeQL [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. On the exact ff349383 worktree, requirements enforcement passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 rows explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check passed; components remain 1.0.0-rc.8. Do not treat post-merge CI as complete until run 40340228722 terminates successfully.\n\n**RC8 upgrade diagnosis and installed artifact:** The attempted RC6-to-RC7