{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:49:10.874Z","ordinal":423285,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17eb1-62db-7543-bdeb-97095e0e59b7","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-422f812e-1098-4810-9d74-d1a5c55a0c1c","process_id":"47715","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show HEAD:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -50; gh pr view 268 --json headRefOid,updatedAt,mergeStateStatus --jq '{head:.headRefOid,updated:.updatedAt,merge:.mergeStateStatus}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show HEAD:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -50; gh pr view 268 --json headRefOid,updatedAt,mergeStateStatus --jq '{head:.headRefOid,updated:.updatedAt,merge:.mergeStateStatus}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 18:38 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `cf05322cc0368af900b2fb425852daa2d0de403e`, merging PR #278 after PR #277. Post-merge CI [40561348972](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348972) remains in progress on that exact SHA; Node 22 and Node 24 are running. CodeQL [40561348985](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348985) passed. Earlier exact-main CI [40554202482](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40554202482) and CodeQL [40554202502](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/40554202502) passed on parent `7a860c0`. A clean detached worktree at `cf05322` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\n\n**Readiness PR #268:** At 18:38 UTC, GitHub reported the remote PR at head `09240beb679c8b593b429c4e6d241af5d975104f`, on base `7a860c0`; Node 22/24 checks were in progress and CodeQL had passed. No independent review was recorded on that head. The checks predate the `cf05322` main merge. This readiness branch now includes `origin/main@cf05322`; the current checkpoint update will advance its PR head again, so its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n\n**Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) addresses the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by merged PR #277. An independent read-only review accepted exact head `a27b0d7c6d2195fb805eb88540a0f4a130b7a888`; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, Node 24 passed, and Node 22 remains pending. Until this corrective PR merges, the findings remain present on main. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; all required exact-head checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. Its provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only; it does not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix.\n\n**Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Exact cross-runner reproducibility passed for immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca`; a successor candidate from current main still requires its own reproducibility run. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\n\nThe 17:31 and earlier checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI, and requirements status by this checkpoint.\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:31 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and post-merge checks:** `origin/main` is `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`, integrating PR #275 after PR #273. Exact-main CI [40537474824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40537474824) passed the Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64` jobs on `ceabfcc`; CodeQL [40537475057](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40537475057) also passed on that SHA. Earlier post-merge CI [40536704465](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704465) and CodeQL [40536704530](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704530) passed on `e94208d`. These establish source CI for those exact commits; they do not establish RC acceptance or release qualification.\n\n**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact remote head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. All exact-head checks passed: Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64` in CI run [40544627770](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40544627770), JavaScript/TypeScript in run `40544627915`, and CodeQL [122332399521](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122332399521). The earlier independent review found stale attribution; the local follow-up corrects it and records the completed Linux result. This corrected follow-up is not yet pushed or independently reviewed. No merge is claimed.\n\n**Merged fixes:** PR #274 merged at `b17c64a2c84a6324fb78bc55d3a39a7c9cc4ed47`; its exact post-merge CI [40529300314](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40529300314) and CodeQL [40529300519](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40529300519) passed. PR #273 merged at `e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2`; PR #275 merged at `ceabfcc`. Both merge commits have the passing exact post-merge checks listed above.\n\n**Other release-path PRs:** PR [#276](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/276) records a synthetic-only qualification-host preflight (10/10) bound to `ceabfcc`; its Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass, while Linux CI remains in progress. Its evidence does not establish custodian access, held-out qualification, or acceptance. PR [#277](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/277) addresses configured Git-hook execution during checkpoint and retention operations. Its exact diff received conflicting review dispositions: a GitHub review comment requested changes for a hook-discovery race and retention error accounting, while a separate read-only review returned ACCEPT. The findings remain unresolved pending the claimed implementation owner's response; no acceptance or merge is claimed. Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; Linux CI remains in progress.\n\n**Requirements and qualification:** A clean disposable snapshot of `origin/main@ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`. The first requirements invocation on the documentation-dirty readiness worktree was correctly refused by its clean-worktree preflight and is not treated as a gate result. The existing [RC10 OpenRouter evidence bundle](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md) establishes a pinned provider verification and one passing synthetic small task; this does not establish the broader provider/standalone matrix. Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains an unaccepted prerelease; no 