{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:51:28.916Z","ordinal":423338,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17eb3-a9cd-72c2-8903-33ec16779f56","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a17eb3-a9cd-72c2-8903-33ec16779f56","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0f2af241481a08f36ad9274907b42","usage":{"input_tokens":157121,"cached_input_tokens":156160,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":140,"reasoning_output_tokens":36,"total_tokens":157261},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":467927,"cached_input_tokens":463360,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1410,"reasoning_output_tokens":996,"total_tokens":469337},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7792047599,"cached_input_tokens":7709063168,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":22262962,"reasoning_output_tokens":12879359,"total_tokens":7814310561}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:51:29.889Z","ordinal":423339,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17eb3-a9cd-72c2-8903-33ec16779f56","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-ca5d4013-2ef9-4e5c-a747-80e6512537bc","process_id":"54125","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '82,100p' docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md; sed -n '1,50p' .git/nexus-claims/V1_DEFECT_RETENTION_REF_FAILURE_ACCOUNTING_20261027/owner.json"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '82,100p' docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md","name":"CONCURRENCY.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,50p' .git/nexus-claims/V1_DEFECT_RETENTION_REF_FAILURE_ACCOUNTING_20261027/owner.json","name":"owner.json","path":".git/nexus-claims/V1_DEFECT_RETENTION_REF_FAILURE_ACCOUNTING_20261027/owner.json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"\n1. Before **every** commit, compare `git rev-parse HEAD` with the commit you last made. Then run `git log <yours>..HEAD` on the branch. If anything foreign appears, stop and reconcile. Never commit generated artifacts (evidence, dist, lockfiles) over a branch that moved (lessons 2026-10-13).\n2. Commits are scoped to the slice. Do not reformat or clean up files outside the boundary.\n3. Merge order follows the precedence rules in §4 and the ROADMAP milestone order. Within a milestone, the slice with fewer hot-file claims merges first.\n4. Rebase onto `origin/main` immediately before merging. Re-run the slice's targeted tests, plus `make test`, on a snapshot of the rebased commit. Merge only if both pass.\n5. Pushing, tagging, publishing and changing GitHub state (issues, milestones, releases) are **owner-approved actions** (DECISIONS X-list). Agents prepare them and do not perform them.\n6. Preserve unrelated user work: the untracked `nexus-continuity-validation/`, the stashes, and any dirty files you did not create. Never stash, reset, clean or check out over them.\n\n## 6. Coordination records\n\n| Record | Where | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| Claims | `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/` | Who owns which slice or file right now |\n| Claim log | `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims.log` (append-only, one line per event) | Claim, release, broken claim, boundary request |\n| Boundary requests and discovered requirements | The PR description, under the heading `Needs from other slices`. Mirrored as one line in the claim log. | So the owning slice's agent can pick it up. Never fixed silently out of scope. |\n| Slice evidence | `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/<plan>-<slice>/` (new directory per slice) | No shared evidence files, so agents cannot overwrite each other's evidence |\n\n## 7. Safe parallel lanes\n\n{\n  \"agent\": \"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/retention-ref-failure-accounting\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/retention-ref-failure-accounting\",\n  \"base\": \"7a860c091297abc13371d92ae9633a9f06d67f7a\",\n  \"head\": \"28694c39ce504296d1f2680dd2864117ec05276b\",\n  \"diff_sha256\": \"77b69884c039e4a58e099da71478416ee6ec1e2109fc6296cd579eca0c45ce44\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"ACCEPT agent-46 at exact clean commit\",\n  \"validation\": \"RED deletedCount=1 before fix; focused 18/18 PASS; build, version, enforced requirements and diff checks PASS\",\n  \"status\": \"Ready for owner PR and exact-head CI; not integrated. SUITE and hot-file claims released\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-27T18:50Z\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":39061}},"started_at_ms":1793127089889,"completed_at_ms":1793127089889}}
