{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T19:09:03.800Z","ordinal":424249,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17eb3-a9cd-72c2-8903-33ec16779f56","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0f6ce34c481a08bc003d036df66dc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The Claude memory observer is unavailable: “Claude rejected the request because its five-hour usage allowance is exhausted.” Restarting it will not restore service.\n\nUnderstood—I didn’t run the terminal cell. I continued on PR #280: the launcher recovery race and interrupted-swap cases are fixed, and an independent reviewer accepted exact head `fd13a8ee`. The focused recovery tests passed **7/7**, and the TypeScript build passed.\n\nExact-head hosted CI is still running its Node 22/24 jobs; CodeQL passed. I’ll keep the merge gated on CI. The manual terminal matrix remains **0/15**, so acceptance is still **IN_PROGRESS**.\n\n[PR #280](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/280)\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":777,"lineEnd":789,"note":"release qualification remains tied to exact source and exact-RC gates"}],"rolloutIds":["01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0"]}},"started_at_ms":1793128142291,"completed_at_ms":1793128143800}}
