_ready_prs=0 all_candidates_clean_with_fc582c6=true requirements=123_enforce_PASS sync_version=1.0.0-rc.10_PASS REDACTED suite_claim=RELEASED gateway_claim=ACTIVE_BY_root(E3_manual_xterm_80x24) cloud_claim=RELEASED latest_rc=v1.0.0-rc.10 rc10_status=PUBLISHED rc10_slsa=VERIFIED rc10_cross_runner_repro=PASS_40564959805 rc10_e2_matrix=16_of_16_PASS REDACTED rc10_a11y=10_states_verified m5_blocker=blackbox_v1_custodian_sealing,15_cell_terminal_matrix_in_progress(1/15_active)\n7:**Readiness PR #268:** At 19:12 UTC, its remote head was `9c153d984ff92eaafa413564ec2401a2a22ecb13`, based on `main@fc582c66`. Node 22/24 CI was queued and CodeQL had started; prior head `398a0ba` passed Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL, with Linux packaging still running. Those checks do not qualify the new merged-base head. This checkpoint update advances PR #268 again; its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n9:**Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) corrected the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by #277. It merged at `fc582c6` after exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent read-only review passed. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; its checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. That provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only. Open PR [#280](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/280) addresses configured state-directory recovery; Node 22/24 are running, while JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass. Open PR [#281](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281) records RC10 cross-runner reproducibility; its Node 22/24 and JavaScript/TypeScript checks are running. These PRs do not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix or release acceptance.\n13:The 18:38, 17:31, and earlier checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI, and requirements status by this checkpoint.\n15:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:31 UTC)\n19:**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact remote head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. All exact-head checks passed: Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64` in CI run [40544627770](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40544627770), JavaScript/TypeScript in run `40544627915`, and CodeQL [122332399521](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122332399521). The earlier independent review found stale attribution; the local follow-up corrects it and records the completed Linux result. This corrected follow-up is not yet pushed or independently reviewed. No merge is claimed.\n23:**Other release-path PRs:** PR [#276](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/276) records a synthetic-only qualification-host preflight (10/10) bound to `ceabfcc`; its Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass, while Linux CI remains in progress. Its evidence does not establish custodian access, held-out qualification, or acceptance. PR [#277](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/277) addresses configured Git-hook execution during checkpoint and retention operations. Its exact diff received conflicting review dispositions: a GitHub review comment requested changes for a hook-discovery race and retention error accounting, while a separate read-only review returned ACCEPT. The findings remain unresolved pending the claimed implementation owner's response; no acceptance or merge is claimed. Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; Linux CI remains in progress.\n36:**Readiness PR #268:** The owner refreshed PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) onto `main`; GitHub shows it open and mergeable at head `98f87bee6ca112e6d50f6fb2bc480fc47723c648`, based on `3b7af5d3cd46ab1b83e9c8df9862e09cee22b1a7`. Its Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks pass; Linux packaging/reproducibility run [40524245685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40524245685) is still pending. The 14:38 checkpoint update was independently accepted (diff SHA-256 `c8cf46163cd8be8666ea86e8a95a7483588e10aa3e8775fbfa213ce55895d41e`). The current local follow-up records terminal main and #269 CI plus the latest PR state; it has not been pushed, and no PR merge is claimed.\n88:**Verifier candidate:** PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266) was updated to exact head `965a0c6f02aa1e4917563b648f7f20089592ba61`, based on `303ea32`. Independent source review accepted this exact commit. Focused verifier tests passed 6/6. At this checkpoint CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; Node 22 and Node 24 CI were still running ([run 40457644361](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40457644361)). Do not merge until all exact-head checks pass. A separate local full-suite attempt on an older snapshot exited nonzero while a duplicate suite overlapped; its outcomes are unqualified and are not represented as passing evidence.\n114:**Current convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264), head `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`, has independent ACCEPT; Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while its Linux package job remains in progress. It records scripted terminal evidence only and does not complete the manual terminal gate. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266), head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` on the same prior base, has Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passing; its Node 22 TUI test failure is being rerun, currently in progress. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267), head `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on current base `14a9c15`, carries the malformed credential-origin fix. Its exact two-file diff has independent ACCEPT (SHA-256 `2da500d09522bc059f63b07251953c552ac2270168c72d43920b181e44fd89d3`) and the focused provider connection suite passed 37/37 after rebase; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs are running and CodeQL passed. None of these PRs is integrated yet. PR #265 merged at `14a9c152`; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed. Its OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task, not full provider or standalone qualification.\n172:**Authoritative source and source gates:** origin/main is ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4, the merge commit for PR #255. PR #255's exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is still running Node 22/24 on ff349383; post-merge CodeQL [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. On the exact ff349383 worktree, requirements enforcement passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 rows explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check passed; components remain 1.0.0-rc.8. Do not treat post-merge CI as complete until run 40340228722 terminates successfully.\n215:**PR #246 / `agent.ts`:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) has been updated onto current `main`; its exact head is `2351e57ace040a48e9ff082d285a5d7edc8ed385`, based on `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. `KimiCode-defect-scan` retains the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. The implementation patch hash remains identical to the previously independently accepted diff (`d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`). Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; CI run [40259036321](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40259036321) has Node 22 and Node 24 jobs still running. No merge has occurred; require those checks to finish successfully before integration.\n225:**PR #246 / `agent.ts` handoff:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) remains open at `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`. Its exact-head run [40255358554](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255358554), CodeQL run [40255358512](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255358512), and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed on that old base; these are not current-main integration evidence. `KimiCode-defect-scan` owns `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts`, branch `v1/defect-agent-readonly-current`, worktree `/home/mike/nexus-wt/agent-readonly-current`. The claims log records handoff at 01:54 UTC and an actionable handoff checkpoint at 02:24 UTC: the previously active current-main CI has completed successfully, so Kimi can update the branch normally onto current `origin/main`, then rerun exact-head checks and obtain any required independent re-review. At this checkpoint the PR branch is still on its old base and has not been integrated.\n239:**PR #246 / `agent.ts` handoff:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) remains open at head `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`. Exact-head run [40255358554](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255358554) completed successfully across Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64, including Linux package reproducibility. CodeQL run `40255358512` and JavaScript/TypeScript checks also passed. `KimiCode-defect-scan` retains the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. A read-only merge-tree preflight against current `main` found no conflicts, but the branch has not yet been updated or merged. The claims log records that Kimi's next step is to update normally onto current `main` and rerun exact-head checks; the old-base run is not integration evidence.\n253:**PR #246 / `agent.ts` handoff:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) remains open at `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`; `KimiCode-defect-scan` owns the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. Its Node 22/24 tests, CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. In Linux job 121360325779, the CLI suite passed at 02:12:07 UTC, the first Linux package build passed at 02:13:55 UTC, and the reproducibility package build was still running at 02:14 UTC. A read-only merge-tree preflight against current `main` produced `f9653711777c4ad9be0aff59db816ea57b3dfd83` without conflicts; no branch update or merge has been performed. After all current checks finish, the recorded path remains a normal update onto current `main` followed by exact-head checks.\n267:**`agent.ts` handoff / PR #246:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) is open at head `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, still based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`. The slice has independent source-review ACCEPT and targeted build/tests passed, while its exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 suites remain in progress; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. At 01:54 UTC the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim was handed from `codex-root` to `KimiCode-defect-scan` with the branch and worktree recorded. The handoff requires waiting for the current checks to finish, merging current `origin/main` normally, and rerunning exact-head checks before integration.\n293:**Candidate changes:** PR #241 merged source/version preparation at `431cb194`, and signed RC7 tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` points to that exact source. PR #243 is refreshed onto exact base `431cb194` at he