acking compatibility metadata (0.071919ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7664269Z ✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (22.708787ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7665131Z ▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7665826Z   ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (3.7994ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7666565Z   ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (1.438881ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7667314Z ✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (5.362068ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7668130Z ▶ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7668932Z   ✔ recovers an interrupted upgrade that crashed during downloading or staging (115.830579ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7669823Z   ✔ fails closed without deleting paths named by a malicious journal (1.855788ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7670559Z   ✔ rejects a staging path whose apparent parent is redirected by a symlink (1.633296ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7671322Z   ✖ accepts backup paths under HOME with a custom installation prefix (2.016527ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7672070Z   ✔ never executes a target binary redirected outside its version directory (119.627631ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7672953Z   ✔ does not repoint the launcher to an external source symlink during early recovery (2.660754ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7673841Z   ✔ rolls back when a contained target launcher exits unsuccessfully (114.85878ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7674675Z   ✔ recovers a crash during switching by reverting symlink to source installation (103.848898ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7675459Z   ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (103.017824ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7676298Z   ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (0.530354ms)\n2026-10-27T19:25:26.7713118Z   ✔ retries an idempotent download once af