ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive containing disallowed entry types (FIFOs, devices, hardlinks) (4.406301ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive with duplicate entries (4.228476ms)\n  ✔ safely extracts valid archive and validates containment walk (18.831663ms)\n✔ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (83.194192ms)\n▶ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09)\n  ✔ creates protected config and state backups with 0600 file and 0700 dir permissions (168.656891ms)\n  ✔ restores configuration cleanly from backup with strict 0600 permissions (175.724831ms)\n✔ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09) (344.841783ms)\n▶ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07)\n  ✔ validates and generates valid compatibility metadata (2.28648ms)\n  ✔ package validator rejects unsupported compatibility schemas (74.366364ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed compatibility metadata (0.481483ms)\n  ✔ refuses downgrade when target release state schema is older than current state schema (0.93718ms)\n  ✔ enforces minimum supported config and state schema versions (0.720127ms)\n  ✔ compares minimum updater versions using full SemVer prerelease ordering (0.554705ms)\n  ✔ rejects a target config schema older than the current config schema (0.371976ms)\n  ✔ applies legacy policy for releases lacking compatibility metadata (0.351518ms)\n✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (80.896135ms)\n▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n  ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (17.878104ms)\n  ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (16.925486ms)\n✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (35.195683ms)\n▶ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12)\n  ✔ recovers an interrupted upgrade that crashed during downloading or staging (423.964603ms)\n  ✔ fails closed without deleting paths named by a malicious journal (24.643586ms)\n  ✔ rejects a staging path whose apparent parent is redirected by a symlink (29.581341ms)\n  ✔ accepts backup paths under HOME with a custom installation prefix (18.675643ms)\n  ✔ never executes a target binary redirected outside its version directory (442.225731ms)\n  ✔ does not repoint the launcher to an external source symlink during early recovery (44.399935ms)\n  ✔ rolls back when a contained target launcher exits unsuccessfully (444.074776ms)\n  ✔ recovers a crash during switching by reverting symlink to source installation (430.142127ms)\n  ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (387.381322ms)\n  ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (2.327333ms)\n  ✔ retries an idempotent download once after a connection reset (64.527468ms)\n✔ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12) (2313.803418ms)\nℹ tests 36\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 36\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 3418.622094\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":4,"nanos":423470495}},"started_at_ms":1793129832805,"completed_at_ms":1793129837229}}
