{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T19:39:36.432Z","ordinal":425369,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ec5-069e-7660-98c6-af7c51147c1b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c028437f-123f-43d8-9768-9faf2192738e","process_id":"98027","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","test_home=$(mktemp -d /tmp/nexus-pr280-focused-home.XXXXXX)\nHOME=\"$test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$test_home/.config\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$test_home/.cache\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/upgrade_safety.test.ts test/upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/state-home-alias-backup/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"test_home=$(mktemp -d /tmp/nexus-pr280-focused-home.XXXXXX)\nHOME=\"$test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$test_home/.config\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$test_home/.cache\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/upgrade_safety.test.ts test/upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"▶ Download Origin, Redirect & Bounds Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08)\n  ✔ validates allowed release download origins (2.821933ms)\n  ✔ rejects downloads redirecting to disallowed hosts or exceeding hop limits (93.332615ms)\n  ✔ follows the allowlisted signed GitHub release-asset redirect without forwarding credentials (20.261615ms)\n✔ Download Origin, Redirect & Bounds Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (119.120475ms)\n▶ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08)\n  ✔ verifies path safety checks: rejects traversal and absolute paths (1.99079ms)\n  ✔ verifies symlink safety: rejects symlinks escaping package root (1.405247ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with path traversal (18.936293ms)\n  ✔ rejects oversized PAX metadata before retaining or parsing it (3.630345ms)\n  ✔ keeps global PAX link overrides active across later entries (6.109616ms)\n  ✔ rejects local and global PAX size overrides that diverge from extraction accounting (7.566748ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with escaping symlink (11.932495ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive containing disallowed entry types (FIFOs, devices, hardlinks) (4.381079ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive with duplicate entries (4.135485ms)\n  ✔ safely extracts valid archive and validates containment walk (19.39893ms)\n✔ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (81.599372ms)\n▶ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09)\n  ✔ creates protected config and state backups with 0600 file and 0700 dir permissions (111.670214ms)\n  ✔ restores configuration cleanly from backup with strict 0600 permissions (204.199285ms)\n✔ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09) (316.360851ms)\n▶ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07)\n  ✔ validates and generates valid compatibility metadata (2.282859ms)\n  ✔ package validator rejects unsupported compatibility schemas (82.797302ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed compatibility metadata (0.445441ms)\n  ✔ refuses downgrade when target release state schema is older than current state schema (1.053329ms)\n  ✔ enforces minimum supported config and state schema versions (0.868921ms)\n  ✔ compares minimum updater versions using full SemVer prerelease ordering (0.696296ms)\n  ✔ rejects a target config schema older than the current config schema (0.438827ms)\n  ✔ applies legacy policy for releases lacking compatibility metadata (0.31335ms)\n✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (89.722299ms)\n▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n  ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (17.415923ms)\n  ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (14.87576ms)\n✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (32.700662ms)\n▶ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12)\n  ✔ recovers an interrupted upgrade that crashed during downloading or staging (456.386542ms)\n  ✔ fails closed without deleting paths named by a malicious journal (31.181381ms)\n  ✔ rejects a staging path whose apparent parent is redirected by a symlink (29.994601ms)\n  ✔ accepts backup paths under HOME with a custom installation prefix (16.8946ms)\n  ✔ never executes a target binary redirected outside its version directory (467.09532ms)\n  ✔ does not repoint the launcher to an external source symlink during early recovery (43.002675ms)\n  ✔ rolls back when a contained target launcher exits unsuccessfully (465.285622ms)\n  ✔ recovers a crash during switching by reverting symlink to source installation (490.395199ms)\n  ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (389.043314ms)\n  ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (2.123559ms)\n  ✔ retries an idempotent download once after a connection reset (55.892923ms)\n✔ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12) (2449.072773ms)\n▶ managed client invocation classification\n  ✔ keeps ambiguous maintenance options on the normal client path (1.973413ms)\n  ✔ releases the normal client lease only for recognized metadata and restore commands (0.503094ms)\n✔ managed client invocation classification (5.256855ms)\n▶ durable same-version transaction recovery\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash before-old-move (826.660095ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-old-move (1184.572685ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-new-move (1204.758059ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-provenance (1221.939627ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-link (1224.653096ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-failed-displacement (1186.789853ms)\n  ✔ retains backups and truthful journal when restoring the link fails (884.577298ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher file and refuses downloading recovery (427.117974ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher file and refuses verified recovery (417.685722ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher substituted after inspection (539.010885ms)\n  ✔ restores an entry displaced by a process interrupted before launcher installation (799.327083ms)\n  ✔ continues after a process is interrupted while restoring the original symlink (458.47859ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher after an interrupted restore left both hard links (457.619156ms)\n  ✔ admits only one recovery when two contenders both observe the same stale lock (1215.946853ms)\n  ✔ reclaims a stale lock through the kernel guard without contention (448.689926ms)\n  ✔ reports the guard path and stays back while a live reclaimer holds the kernel guard (474.654441ms)\n  ✔ acquires the kernel guard after its holder is killed (673.070657ms)\n  ✔ does not leak descriptors across repeated guard contention (267.181252ms)\n  ✔ fails closed when the flock utility is unavailable (8.092582ms)\n  ✔ rejects a symlinked reclaim guard (4.286268ms)\n  ✔ rejects a FIFO reclaim guard (11.990229ms)\n  ✔ rejects a reclaim guard with unsafe permissions (3.790367ms)\n  ✔ does not touch the lock for a completed journal in a read-only package directory (1061.920885ms)\n  ✔ does not finalize a launcher that reports the wrong release (929.563633ms)\n  ✔ refuses missing runtime components despite a successful version shim (45.803834ms)\n  ✔ uses the actual previous same-version package for explicit binary rollback (875.249012ms)\n  ✔ rejects a redirected backup without touching outside data (37.39064ms)\n  ✔ check-only leaves a pending transaction byte-for-byte unchanged (1012.970523ms)\n  ✔ explicit recovery rejects invalid journals with an operational exit (1101.892748ms)\n  ✔ bounds hung probes and kills their process group (278.157994ms)\n✔ durable same-version transaction recovery (19289.06365ms)\n▶ complete private state/config backup restore\n  ✔ reports byte progress while a single large file is still being copied (90.420603ms)\n  ✔ reports only aggregate backup progress and syncs each copied directory once (374.271543ms)\n  ✔ restores session payloads and config rather than copying an archive into config.env (763.532644ms)\n  ✔ captures and restores task and session state rooted at NEXUS_STATE_DIR (330.567557ms)\n  ✔ honors NEXUS_STATE_DIR when HOME is a symlink (295.091089ms)\n  ✔ flushes every automatic backup payload and containing directory before returning (100.91642ms)\n  ✔ preserves an existing backup when exclusive creation reports EEXIST (8.294886ms)\n  ✔ does not merge into an existing timestamped state backup directory (10.664498ms)\n  ✔ keeps committed restore barriers until staged payload cleanup succeeds (233.754997ms)\n  ✔ replays a prepared restore after interruption and blocks state access until recovery (216.31103ms)\n  ✔ fails closed when a per-store marker survives without its global journal (2.775879ms)\n  ✔ fails closed on dangling active and per-store restore markers (2.924361ms)\n  ✔ replays a pending restore rooted at NEXUS_STATE_DIR before starting the REPL (1442.359656ms)\n  ✔ refuses upgrade --check before loading config when restore is pending (754.470377ms)\n  ✔ routes launches before legacy-client census and resumes after the legacy client exits (724.042779ms)\n  ✔ keeps a restore pending while a detached legacy client outlives its launcher (481.048254ms)\n✔ complete private state/config backup restore (5834.913913ms)\n▶ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_preserved (1778.88658ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_moved (1760.31502ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after provenance_written (1755.853269ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after launch