{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T19:45:20.672Z","ordinal":425597,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ec5-069e-7660-98c6-af7c51147c1b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a2d6072d-a66b-4845-a1ef-cdc8e6ff1deb","process_id":"19667","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/upgrade_safety.test.ts test/upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/state-home-alias-backup/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/upgrade_safety.test.ts test/upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"▶ Download Origin, Redirect & Bounds Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08)\n  ✔ validates allowed release download origins (2.512387ms)\n  ✔ rejects downloads redirecting to disallowed hosts or exceeding hop limits (93.172442ms)\n  ✔ follows the allowlisted signed GitHub release-asset redirect without forwarding credentials (24.316652ms)\n✔ Download Origin, Redirect & Bounds Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (123.162434ms)\n▶ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08)\n  ✔ verifies path safety checks: rejects traversal and absolute paths (3.236007ms)\n  ✔ verifies symlink safety: rejects symlinks escaping package root (1.595686ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with path traversal (22.020525ms)\n  ✔ rejects oversized PAX metadata before retaining or parsing it (5.370048ms)\n  ✔ keeps global PAX link overrides active across later entries (12.757124ms)\n  ✔ rejects local and global PAX size overrides that diverge from extraction accounting (7.476605ms)\n  ✔ rejects malicious tar archive with escaping symlink (4.964014ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive containing disallowed entry types (FIFOs, devices, hardlinks) (5.141626ms)\n  ✔ rejects archive with duplicate entries (4.91012ms)\n  ✔ safely extracts valid archive and validates containment walk (20.407814ms)\n✔ Tar Archive Structural Safety Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-08) (90.56452ms)\n▶ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09)\n  ✔ creates protected config and state backups with 0600 file and 0700 dir permissions (127.46286ms)\n  ✔ restores configuration cleanly from backup with strict 0600 permissions (247.983841ms)\n✔ Pre-Migration Backups & Migration/Downgrade Safety (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09) (375.858461ms)\n▶ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07)\n  ✔ validates and generates valid compatibility metadata (3.149108ms)\n  ✔ package validator rejects unsupported compatibility schemas (71.414965ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed compatibility metadata (0.422194ms)\n  ✔ refuses downgrade when target release state schema is older than current state schema (0.91305ms)\n  ✔ enforces minimum supported config and state schema versions (0.724273ms)\n  ✔ compares minimum updater versions using full SemVer prerelease ordering (0.59406ms)\n  ✔ rejects a target config schema older than the current config schema (0.464324ms)\n  ✔ applies legacy policy for releases lacking compatibility metadata (0.359362ms)\n✔ Machine-Readable Compatibility & Downgrade State Rejection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-07) (78.856079ms)\n▶ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10)\n  ✔ writes and reads durable installation provenance record (25.27301ms)\n  ✔ detects package-manager installations and blocks self-upgrade (21.628552ms)\n✔ Durable Provenance & Package-Manager Protection (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-10) (47.280499ms)\n▶ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12)\n  ✔ resolves the state root when HOME has not been created yet (1.639161ms)\n  ✔ recovers an interrupted upgrade that crashed during downloading or staging (828.146017ms)\n  ✔ fails closed without deleting paths named by a malicious journal (24.311851ms)\n  ✔ rejects a staging path whose apparent parent is redirected by a symlink (29.884963ms)\n  ✔ accepts backup paths under HOME with a custom installation prefix (18.924914ms)\n  ✔ never executes a target binary redirected outside its version directory (443.669916ms)\n  ✔ does not repoint the launcher to an external source symlink during early recovery (51.934092ms)\n  ✔ rolls back when a contained target launcher exits unsuccessfully (862.204805ms)\n  ✔ recovers a crash during switching by reverting symlink to source installation (453.952745ms)\n  ✔ reverts launcher symlink to previous release with rollbackBinary (414.030406ms)\n  ✔ detects PATH shadowing when another nexus executable precedes prefix bin in PATH (2.522766ms)\n  ✔ retries an idempotent download once after a connection reset (54.348995ms)\n✔ Upgrade Journal, Crash Recovery & PATH Shadowing (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-11, ACC-UPG-12) (3187.628544ms)\n▶ managed client invocation classification\n  ✔ keeps ambiguous maintenance options on the normal client path (2.728776ms)\n  ✔ releases the normal client lease only for recognized metadata and restore commands (0.780046ms)\n✔ managed client invocation classification (6.981702ms)\n▶ durable same-version transaction recovery\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash before-old-move (1367.764828ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-old-move (1247.463937ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-new-move (1545.474019ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-provenance (1239.079996ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-link (1594.367433ms)\n  ✔ preserves the only working package after crash after-failed-displacement (1590.617232ms)\n  ✔ retains backups and truthful journal when restoring the link fails (1164.26311ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher file and refuses downloading recovery (412.167725ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher file and refuses verified recovery (1020.028594ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher substituted after inspection (855.675461ms)\n  ✔ restores an entry displaced by a process interrupted before launcher installation (791.66219ms)\n  ✔ continues after a process is interrupted while restoring the original symlink (424.895601ms)\n  ✔ preserves a regular launcher after an interrupted restore left both hard links (442.079959ms)\n  ✔ admits only one recovery when two contenders both observe the same stale lock (1476.121577ms)\n  ✔ reclaims a stale lock through the kernel guard without contention (825.533516ms)\n  ✔ reports the guard path and stays back while a live reclaimer holds the kernel guard (446.70972ms)\n  ✔ acquires the kernel guard after its holder is killed (663.608352ms)\n  ✔ does not leak descriptors across repeated guard contention (258.639167ms)\n  ✔ fails closed when the flock utility is unavailable (8.428268ms)\n  ✔ rejects a symlinked reclaim guard (6.299823ms)\n  ✔ rejects a FIFO reclaim guard (8.849001ms)\n  ✔ rejects a reclaim guard with unsafe permissions (3.899561ms)\n  ✔ does not touch the lock for a completed journal in a read-only package directory (818.727835ms)\n  ✔ does not finalize a launcher that reports the wrong release (910.741167ms)\n  ✔ refuses missing runtime components despite a successful version shim (52.686494ms)\n  ✔ uses the actual previous same-version package for explicit binary rollback (1272.526331ms)\n  ✔ rejects a redirected backup without touching outside data (36.718401ms)\n  ✔ check-only leaves a pending transaction byte-for-byte unchanged (776.029424ms)\n  ✔ explicit recovery rejects invalid journals with an operational exit (991.365166ms)\n  ✔ bounds hung probes and kills their process group (266.63766ms)\n✔ durable same-version transaction recovery (22525.793814ms)\n▶ complete private state/config backup restore\n  ✔ reports byte progress while a single large file is still being copied (87.223016ms)\n  ✔ reports only aggregate backup progress and syncs each copied directory once (726.853405ms)\n  ✔ restores session payloads and config rather than copying an archive into config.env (1568.003075ms)\n  ✔ captures and restores task and session state rooted at NEXUS_STATE_DIR (689.80206ms)\n  ✔ honors NEXUS_STATE_DIR when HOME is a symlink (871.663871ms)\n  ✔ flushes every automatic backup payload and containing directory before returning (96.098738ms)\n  ✔ preserves an existing backup when exclusive creation reports EEXIST (7.653344ms)\n  ✔ does not merge into an existing timestamped state backup directory (9.835253ms)\n  ✔ keeps committed restore barriers until staged payload cleanup succeeds (567.010164ms)\n  ✔ replays a prepared restore after interruption and blocks state access until recovery (245.733818ms)\n  ✔ fails closed when a per-store marker survives without its global journal (2.754516ms)\n  ✔ fails closed on dangling active and per-store restore markers (3.150516ms)\n  ✔ replays a pending restore rooted at NEXUS_STATE_DIR before starting the REPL (918.705805ms)\n  ✔ refuses upgrade --check before loading config when restore is pending (745.570103ms)\n  ✔ routes launches before legacy-client census and resumes after the legacy client exits (763.534283ms)\n  ✔ keeps a restore pending while a detached legacy client outlives its launcher (792.260763ms)\n✔ complete private state/config backup restore (8098.452213ms)\n▶ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_preserved (2864.190532ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after package_moved (1686.204502ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after provenance_written (1885.797829ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after launcher_switched (1720.517558ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after verifying_install (2467.920755ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after installed_wrong_version (2656.450763ms)\n  ✔ restores the real previous same-version package after kill_after_package_move (3494.947124ms)\n✔ live transaction exceptions after each destructive boundary (16778.407737ms)\n✔ rollback preserves permanent state guard inodes absent from an older snapshot (403.153189ms)\nℹ tests 93\nℹ suites 10\nℹ pass 93\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 52565.25415\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":53,"nanos":568571758}},"started_at_ms":1793130267100,"completed_at_ms":1793130320669}}
