l%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai&mini=true&title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-27T19:10:33Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281#issuecomment-6451182246\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgIXq6Q\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Read-Only Review: PR #281 (`v1/evidence-repro-rc10-20261027`, Head `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9`)\\n\\n**Verdict**: **ACCEPT**\\n\\n#### 1. Invariant & Boundary Verification\\n- **Target Branch & Clean Base:** Head `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9` is cleanly based on current `origin/main` at `fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540` (fast-forwardable, zero conflicts) and merges cleanly with PR #280 (`a9d47ffe`) and PR #268 (`398a0bab`).\\n- **Change Boundary:** Strictly confined to `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/repro-evidence.json` (+111 / -0 across 2 files).\\n- **Exact Diff SHA-256:** `6ef6caa0de14cfbd34b9549fdfb51046300f3bb89d497d9ae24b6d4113b8e040` (`git diff fc582c66...e1741941`).\\n- **Formatting & Whitespace Check:** `git diff --check` passed with 0 errors.\\n\\n#### 2. Evidence & Gate Integrity Review\\n- Accurately records workflow run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) (`repro.yml` on `v1.0.0-rc.10`, commit `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`), where `ubuntu-22.04` (`20261023.322.3`) and `ubuntu-24.04` (`20261023.334.3`) independently rebuilt byte-identical release artifacts (`nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.10.tar.gz` SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`, `SHA256SUMS`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`, `sbom.cdx.json`, `compatibility.json`, and `install.sh`).\\n- Preserves ledger boundaries by leaving `REQ-REL-114` promotion in `docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md` to the ledger owner / exact-RC qualification.\\n\\n#### 3. Validation Receipts\\n- Isolated detached worktree at `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9`:\\n  - `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: **✓ PASSED** (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification).\\n  - `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`: **✓ PASSED** (all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`).\\n\\n**Disposition:** ACCEPT. Ready for merge once exact-head CI and CodeQL complete.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-27T19:12:50Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281#issuecomment-6451227369\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"headRefOid\":\"e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"CLEAN\",\"number\":281,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[],\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-27T19:26:28Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566980576/job/122410756827\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-27T19:12:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflow