ol%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai&mini=true&title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\\\n\\\\n</dd>\\\\n</dl>\\\\n</details>\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\\\n\\\\n<!-- tips_end -->\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:10:33Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"isMinimized\\\":false,\\\"minimizedReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281#issuecomment-6451182246\\\",\\\"viewerDidAuthor\\\":false},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgIXq6Q\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"OWNER\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"### Independent Read-Only Review: PR #281 (`v1/evidence-repro-rc10-20261027`, Head `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9`)\\\\n\\\\n**Verdict**: **ACCEPT**\\\\n\\\\n#### 1. Invariant & Boundary Verification\\\\n- **Target Branch & Clean Base:** Head `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9` is cleanly based on current `origin/main` at `fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540` (fast-forwardable, zero conflicts) and merges cleanly with PR #280 (`a9d47ffe`) and PR #268 (`398a0bab`).\\\\n- **Change Boundary:** Strictly confined to `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/repro-evidence.json` (+111 / -0 across 2 files).\\\\n- **Exact Diff SHA-256:** `6ef6caa0de14cfbd34b9549fdfb51046300f3bb89d497d9ae24b6d4113b8e040` (`git diff fc582c66...e1741941`).\\\\n- **Formatting & Whitespace Check:** `git diff --check` passed with 0 errors.\\\\n\\\\n#### 2. Evidence & Gate Integrity Review\\\\n- Accurately records workflow run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) (`repro.yml` on `v1.0.0-rc.10`, commit `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`), where `ubuntu-22.04` (`20261023.322.3`) and `ubuntu-24.04` (`20261023.334.3`) independently rebuilt byte-identical release artifacts (`nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.10.tar.gz` SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`, `SHA256SUMS`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`, `sbom.cdx.json`, `compatibility.json`, and `install.sh`).\\\\n- Preserves ledger boundaries by leaving `REQ-REL-114` promotion in `docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md` to the ledger owner / exact-RC qualification.\\\\n\\\\n#### 3. Validation Receipts\\\\n- Isolated detached worktree at `e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9`:\\\\n  - `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: **✓ PASSED** (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification).\\\\n  - `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10`: **✓ PASSED** (all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`).\\\\n\\\\n**Disposition:** ACCEPT. Ready for merge once exact-head CI and CodeQL complete.\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:12:50Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"isMinimized\\\":false,\\\"minimizedReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281#issuecomment-6451227369\\\",\\\"viewerDidAuthor\\\":true}],\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9\\\",\\\"mergeStateStatus\\\":\\\"CLEAN\\\",\\\"number\\\":281,\\\"reviewDecision\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reviews\\\":[],\\\"statusCheckRollup\\\":[{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:26:28Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566980576/job/122410756827\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (22)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:12:24Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:13:41Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566980672/job/122410757049\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"javascript-typescript\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:12:24Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CodeQL\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:29:51Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566980576/job/122410757841\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (24)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:12:25Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:52:45Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566980576/job/122420085587\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux-x86_64\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:29:53Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"CI\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"CheckRun\\\",\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:13:33Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"detailsUrl\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/122411369006\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"CodeQL\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:13:30Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"COMPLETED\\\",\\\"workflowName\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"StatusContext\\\",\\\"context\\\":\\\"CodeRabbit\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-27T19:10:34Z\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"SUCCESS\\\",\\\"targetUrl\\\":\\\"\\\"}],\\\"title\\\":\\\"docs(evidence): record RC10 cross-runner reproducibility pass\\\"}\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"d58c2f\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.750307639,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":502,\"output\":\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md\\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/repro-evidence.json\\nunknown flag: --stat\\n\\nView changes in a pull request.\\n\\nWithout an argument, the pull request that belongs to the current branch\\nis selected.\\n\\nWith `--web` flag, open the pull request diff in a web browser instead.\\n\\nUse `--exclude` to filter out files matching a glob pattern. The pattern\\nuses forward slashes as path separators on all platforms. You can repeat\\nthe flag to exclude multiple patterns.\\n\\nBy default, terminal escape sequences in the diff are neutralized, since\\nthey could manipulate your terminal. Pass `--allow-escape-sequences` to\\nprint the diff verbatim, for example when piping a patch to another program.\\n\\n\\nUSAGE\\n  gh pr diff [<number> | <url> | <branch>] [flags]\\n\\nFLAGS\\n      --allow-escape-sequences   Allow printing terminal escape sequences\\n      --color string             Use color in diff output: {always|never|auto} (default \\\"auto\\\")\\n  -e, --exclude patterns         Exclude files matching glob patterns from the diff\\n      --name-only                Display only names of changed files\\n      --patch                    Display diff in patch format\\n  -w, --web                      Open the pull request diff in the browser\\n\\nINHERITED FLAGS\\n      --help                     Show help for command\\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\\n\\nEXAMPLES\\n  # See diff for current branch\\n  $ gh pr diff\\n  \\n  # See diff for a specific PR\\n  $ gh pr diff 123\\n  \\n  # Exclude files from diff output\\n  $ gh pr diff --exclude '*.yml' --exclude 'generated/*'\\n  \\n  # Exclude matching files by name\\n  $ gh pr diff --name-only --exclude '*.generated.*'\\n\\nLEARN MORE\\n  Use `gh <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.\\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\\n  Learn about exit codes using `gh help exit-codes`\\n  Learn about accessibility experiences using `gh help accessibility`\\n\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17ec5-069e-7660-98c6-af7c51147c1b","create_time":1793130906.4954245}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
