{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T19:56:21.072Z","ordinal":425940,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ec5-069e-7660-98c6-af7c51147c1b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f3979c59-ca9e-4c6b-b1f8-b70a65ce9b2c","process_id":"56379","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr diff 268 --patch | rg -n -C 6 'REL-114|cross-runner|reproducibility|40564959805|REQ-REL-114' | head -100; find /home/mike/nexus-wt -maxdepth 2 -type d -iname '*readiness*' -print"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr diff 268 --patch | rg -n -C 6 'REL-114|cross-runner|reproducibility|40564959805|REQ-REL-114' | head -100; find /home/mike/nexus-wt -maxdepth 2 -type d -iname '*readiness*' -print"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"17-+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 03:44 UTC)\n18-+\n19-+**Authoritative source:** `origin/main` is `14a9c15297c3c50dd8fbda86e34aeae447bb5a5d`, merging PR #265. On a clean detached worktree at this exact commit, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 gates remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10` also passed (all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`). Post-merge CI [40445344587](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445344587) is still running its Node 22 and Node 24 matrices; post-merge CodeQL [40445344556](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40445344556) passed on that exact commit. Do not aggregate the still-running source CI with older successful runs.\n20-+\n21-+**Current convergence PRs:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264), head `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on base `2622663313132864677cfdc93c94944d26a3ac06`, has independent ACCEPT; Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while its Linux package job remains in progress. It records scripted terminal evidence only and does not complete the manual terminal gate. PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266), head `11fc29ba39bc76624c55d34a1fc12b4d7544522a` on the same prior base, has Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passing; its Node 22 TUI test failure is being rerun, currently in progress. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267), head `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on current base `14a9c15`, carries the malformed credential-origin fix. Its exact two-file diff has independent ACCEPT (SHA-256 `2da500d09522bc059f63b07251953c552ac2270168c72d43920b181e44fd89d3`) and the focused provider connection suite passed 37/37 after rebase; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs are running and CodeQL passed. None of these PRs is integrated yet. PR #265 merged at `14a9c152`; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed. Its OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task, not full provider or standalone qualification.\n22-+\n23:+**RC10 artifact boundary:** The latest published prerelease is [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, not current main. Its Linux archive SHA-256 is `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. Previously completed RC10 artifact, installation, provenance and cross-runner checks apply only to that immutable artifact. Scripted terminal coverage remains partial; the required manual real-terminal matrix is 0/15. No exact-RC acceptance is established. Further source changes require constructing and qualifying a new candidate.\n24-+\n25-+**Held-out and human gates:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open with no custodian acceptance recorded; no held-out payload was accessed and T2/T3/T4 acceptance is not established. The manual terminal matrix still requires operator evidence across five environments and three sizes. At 2026-10-27 03:49 UTC, I verified over SSH to `ubuntu-desktop` (`10.0.8.3`) that `/home/mike/nexus-rc10-manual-evidence/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md` exists and contains an unfilled 15-cell template with directories for every environment/size pair. No cell evidence is present; the installed candidate identity is blank. Any matrix run must use the eventual installed RC. Scripted PTY output is not a substitute.\n26-+\n27-+**RC8 dogfood export:** `/home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json` records an exploratory codebase-review objective, 28 model-written findings, no candidate identity, zero validation receipts, `unverifiedChangesPending=true`, and a `VERIFIER_FAILED` incomplete outcome. Treat the findings as hypotheses requiring reproduction; they are not verified defects or RC acceptance evidence.\n28-+\n29-+**Disposition:** Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; RC10 is unaccepted and stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Existing publication authorization remains granted but gated on all mandatory qualification and independent acceptance. The user-selected distribution target is the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\n--\n92-+**Authoritative source and pre-RC checks:** `origin/main` is `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4` (PR #267 merged); `origin/v1/integration` remains `7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78`. On a clean detached snapshot of `303ea32`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 rows are explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10` passed. This is source-gate evidence for `303ea32`, not exact-RC acceptance.\n93-+\n94-+**Verifier candidate:** PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266) was updated to exact head `965a0c6f02aa1e4917563b648f7f20089592ba61`, based on `303ea32`. Independent source review accepted this exact commit. Focused verifier tests passed 6/6. At this checkpoint CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; Node 22 and Node 24 CI were still running ([run 40457644361](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40457644361)). Do not merge until all exact-head checks pass. A separate local full-suite attempt on an older snapshot exited nonzero while a duplicate suite overlapped; its outcomes are unqualified and are not represented as passing evidence.\n95-+\n96-+**RC10 installation and terminal preparation:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains an unaccepted prerelease from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; Linux x86_64 archive SHA-256 is `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. On Ubuntu 26.04.1 at `ubuntu-desktop` (`10.0.8.3`), the published installer installed RC10 under isolated `/tmp/nexus-rc10-human-matrix.ol0HgG/prefix`; the installer verified provenance for the archive and checksum index, and the installed CLI reported `1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438)`. xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux 3.6, and VS Code are present. This prepares the host only: the human matrix remains **0/15**. The operator must perform each of the five terminal environments at all three sizes and provide two genuine screenshots and a verdict per cell; scripted PTY evidence does not substitute.\n97-+\n98:+**Remaining exact-RC and release gates:** PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264) archives RC10 scripted observations and keeps the manual matrix separate; its remote head is `73bdc7d91b1b8925b522b052d89228d99bad4893` on a stale base, with all reported exact-head checks successful. Its manual worksheet is blank. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) still lacks custodian acceptance; the sealed public manifest alone is not private custody acceptance, and