Script/TypeScript and CodeQL passing; its Node 22 TUI test failure is being rerun, currently in progress. PR [#267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/267), head `d0cac8b959e3da8595a41651a60a2fcd3738d034` on current base `14a9c15`, carries the malformed credential-origin fix. Its exact two-file diff has independent ACCEPT (SHA-256 `2da500d09522bc059f63b07251953c552ac2270168c72d43920b181e44fd89d3`) and the focused provider connection suite passed 37/37 after rebase; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs are running and CodeQL passed. None of these PRs is integrated yet. PR #265 merged at `14a9c152`; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed. Its OpenRouter evidence covers one pinned-model verification and one synthetic small task, not full provider or standalone qualification.\\n22-+\\n23:+**RC10 artifact boundary:** The latest published prerelease is [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, not current main. Its Linux archive SHA-256 is `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. Previously completed RC10 artifact, installation, provenance and cross-runner checks apply only to that immutable artifact. Scripted terminal coverage remains partial; the required manual real-terminal matrix is 0/15. No exact-RC acceptance is established. Further source changes require constructing and qualifying a new candidate.\\n24-+\\n25-+**Held-out and human gates:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open with no custodian acceptance recorded; no held-out payload was accessed and T2/T3/T4 acceptance is not established. The manual terminal matrix still requires operator evidence across five environments and three sizes. At 2026-10-27 03:49 UTC, I verified over SSH to `ubuntu-desktop` (`10.0.8.3`) that `/home/mike/nexus-rc10-manual-evidence/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md` exists and contains an unfilled 15-cell template with directories for every environment/size pair. No cell evidence is present; the installed candidate identity is blank. Any matrix run must use the eventual installed RC. Scripted PTY output is not a substitute.\\n26-+\\n27-+**RC8 dogfood export:** `/home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json` records an exploratory codebase-review objective, 28 model-written findings, no candidate identity, zero validation receipts, `unverifiedChangesPending=true`, and a `VERIFIER_FAILED` incomplete outcome. Treat the findings as hypotheses requiring reproduction; they are not verified defects or RC acceptance evidence.\\n28-+\\n29-+**Disposition:** Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; RC10 is unaccepted and stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Existing publication authorization remains granted but gated on all mandatory qualification and independent acceptance. The user-selected distribution target is the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\\n--\\n92-+**Authoritative source and pre-RC checks:** `origin/main` is `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4` (PR #267 merged); `origin/v1/integration` remains `7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78`. On a clean detached snapshot of `303ea32`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 rows are explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.10` passed. This is source-gate evidence for `303ea32`, not exact-RC acceptance.\\n93-+\\n94-+**Verifier candidate:** PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266) was updated to exact head `965a0c6f02aa1e4917563b648f7f20089592ba61`, based on `303ea32`. Independent source review accepted this exact commit. Focused verifier tests passed 6/6. At this checkpoint CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; Node 22 and Node 24 CI were still running ([run 40457644361](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40457644361)). Do not merge until all exact-head checks pass. A separate local full-suite attempt on an older snapshot exited nonzero while a duplicate suite overlapped; its outcomes are unqualified and are not represented as passing evidence.\\n95-+\\n96-+**RC10 installation and terminal preparation:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains an unaccepted prerelease from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; Linux x86_64 archive SHA-256 is `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. On Ubuntu…2621 tokens truncated…and hosted checks. No merge is claimed.\\n181-+\\n182-+**RC8 dogfood export disposition:** The export `/home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json` (session `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn`, created 2026-10-26 17:07:51 UTC) records the workspace `/home/mike/nexus-code`, 28 model-written exploratory findings, `candidateId`/candidate identity absent, zero validation receipts, and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. Its task outcome is `VERIFIER_FAILED`: the configured `make test` verifier exited unsuccessfully because it could not establish the required matching pre-change baseline; `hasExecutedTests=false`, so this export does not report a test failure or test pass. The full trace shows one workspace write, `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md`; the shared checkout copy remains untracked and untouched. Treat the 28 findings as hypotheses pending reproduction, not verified defects, completed remediation, or acceptance evidence.\\n183-+\\n184:+**Candidate and gates:** The latest public release remains prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10), built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` with archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`. Stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. The required real-terminal matrix remains **0/15**; scripted terminal evidence does not replace operator evidence. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no recorded custodian acceptance; no private payload was accessed or run. T2/T3/T4, exact-current-RC provider/standalone and cross-runner qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization is granted but gated. The distribution target is the GitHub installer; npm publication is inapplicable.\\n185-+\\n186-+The 11:58 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI and acceptance state by this checkpoint.\\n187-+\\n188-+---\\n189-+\\n190- ## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 11:58 UTC)\\n191- \\n192: **Authoritative source:** `origin/main` is `d2442b0e0aa143191ab5ae478bc243ecce97861e`, which integrates PR [#266](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/266). Post-merge CI [40461301453](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40461301453) and CodeQL [40461301693](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40461301693) both completed successfully. PR #266 exact-head CI, including Node 22, Node 24, Linux tests/package and reproducibility, and CodeQL passed before merge. The source and its local regressions are integrated; this does not qualify the already-published RC10 artifact.\\n193-\\n194-From f457a9aec600e523976c51b90e585e5c844092b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\\n195-From: Mike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\\n196-Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:51:15 +0000\\n197-Subject: [PATCH 07/22] docs(release): qualify incomplete host suite evidence\\n198-\\n--\\n235-+## Historical terminal cancellation checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 02:11 UTC)\\n236-+\\n237-+Five targeted synthetic installed-RC10 cancellation rechecks at `TERM=dumb`, 100×30 completed with Esc delays from 0 to 1 second; idle return measured 0.405–0.507 seconds. The two earlier full-matrix timeouts remained valid and unresolved; this targeted recheck did not promote ACC-TUI-A11Y or E3. Evidence and raw PTY streams are preserved in [the cancellation timing recheck](../reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/README.md). Human terminal acceptance remained 0/15. This historical record is retained from the PR #264 merge history.\\n238-+\\n239- ## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 12:42 UTC)\\n240- \\n241: **Authoritative source and CI:** `origin/main` is `1d9357ee63b1066a891584a898842814de614fbf`, which integrates PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264). PR #264 merged at 12:38:40 UTC after exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) passed its Node 22, Node 24, and Linux package/reproducibility jobs, and CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed. New post-merge main CI [40505388775](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388775) and CodeQL [40505388849](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388849) are still running on exact commit `1d9357e`; their results are not yet established. PR #264 is merged, not open.\\n242-\\n243-From 136e10074c50f0936d8a1dd010540ca31f704409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\\n244-From: Mike Holownych <mike@holownych.com>\\n245-Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:02:04 +0000\\n246-Subject: [PATCH 09/22] docs(release): record current main CI and PR status\\n247-\\n--\\n326- # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n327- \\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-checkpoint\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-readiness-post152\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-post139\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-post159\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-t2\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-postmerge\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/v1readiness\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-current-state\\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-post143\\