lownych/nexus-code/pull/264). PR #264 merged at 12:38:40 UTC after exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) passed its Node 22, Node 24, and Linux package/reproducibility jobs, and CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed. New post-merge main CI [40505388775](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388775) and CodeQL [40505388849](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388849) are still running on exact commit `1d9357e`; their results are not yet established. PR #264 is merged, not open.\n\n**Readiness PR:** PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains open remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`. The local claimed candidate `9344df578f8a39a55d82ead0f15c4811864d21f8` has not passed final-base independent review: the reviewer correctly found its current PR/CI statement stale after PR #264 merged. This checkpoint corrects that statement; the candidate requires fresh exact-head independent review and then owner push and hosted checks. No merge is claimed.\n\n**RC8 dogfood export disposition:** The export `/home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json` (session `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn`, created 2026-10-26 17:07:51 UTC) records the workspace `/home/mike/nexus-code`, 28 model-written exploratory findings, `candidateId`/candidate identity absent, zero validation receipts, and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. Its task outcome is `VERIFIER_FAILED`: the configured `make test` verifier exited unsuccessfully because it could not establish the required matching pre-change baseline; `hasExecutedTests=false`, so this export does not report a test failure or test pass. The full trace shows one workspace write, `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md`; the shared checkout copy remains untracked and