14-rc10-20261027 (PR281 merged 45ca37b4)\n2026-10-27T19:56:30Z REVIEW_CORRECTION PR281 head=e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9 base=fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540 reviewer=rc5_candidate_review disposition=CHANGES_REQUIRED diff_sha256=6ef6caa0de14cfbd34b9549fdfb51046300f3bb89d497d9ae24b6d4113b8e040 finding=\"scope wording must limit byte-identical claim to six compared release artifacts; review completed after merge as 45ca37b\"\n2026-10-27T19:56:30Z SOURCE_GATES main=45ca37b467b5e6a7b42be733be61e6964c73b4fd requirements_enforce=PASS 123_rows_108_tested_6_partial_2_implemented_7_open_12_exact_RC_deferrals version_sync_v1.0.0-rc.10=PASS isolated_HOME_XDG\n2026-10-27T19:58:25Z claude-code INDEPENDENT_REVIEW PR280 head=a68ea10ddaeab73aa5ab96caed1a949940cff144 base=fc582c6 ACCEPT (stateRoot honours NEXUS_STATE_DIR consistently; exclusive link(2) launcher swap Linux-only OK; interrupted-swap reconciliation fails closed). suites head/base: upgrade_acceptance 11/11=11/11, upgrade_safety 37/37 vs 36/36, upgrade_transaction_recovery 56/56 vs 47/47, sidecar 46/55 both (identical env failset, no Rust core). Needs RC11 notes bullet. enforce on main fc582c6 exit 0 (108/6/2/7), version-sync rc.10 ok. RELEASE SUITE scope=PR280_review.\n2026-10-27T19:58:55Z claude-code INDEPENDENT_REVIEW PR281 head=e17419414b3e01d835fd54ae7589e3aad50272d9 ACCEPT (REQ-REL-114 rc.10 evidence matches run 40564959805 4/4 success, tag commit/tree, published SHA256SUMS 760199fc and archive 444d0812).\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28631}},"started_at_ms":1793131215727,"completed_at_ms":1793131215728}}
