"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40573441705\\\"}\\n\"}\nRESULT 3\n{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Continue monitoring exact CI, reconcile PR268 owner-push boundary, and then prepare follow-up to narrow PR281 evidence claim to the six compared artifacts., current_main=45ca37b467b5e6a7b42be733be61e6964c73b4fd; source requirements/version sync pass; post-merge CI active; CodeQL PASS, sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=PR264 evidence owner and PR263 RC10 desktop install-prep owner hold their FILE claims; release publisher owns RC lifecycle. This agent released its unused SUITE/GATEWAY claims on 2026-10-27T02:17Z and did not touch claimed worktrees., blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298 all four jobs SUCCESS and CodeQL39689926282 SUCCESS, but it is based on old main 049880f; main moved to f8ba4c after PR126. Refresh readiness claim to current main after postmerge CI39692357597/CodeQL39692357575 terminal and rerun exact-head checks., main_postmerge_CI=Run40243331324 exact main431cb194: Node22 and Node24 full test matrices SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 remains active at Node runtime install after earlier build/requirements/cargo gates., main_postmerge_CodeQL=Run 40171717805 exact main 05994a4 SUCCESS., PR127=open; refreshed exact head f9d2743decd2dd3a4816f3bd8b5ec7f00d7a8801 based on ac8a97; normal push from remote head 0d87c00; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39706694418 and 39706694528 running, CodeQL39706694522 SUCCESS; SUITE exclusive claim held, contest_freeze=none; user confirms contest has ended, release_status=Only public releases are prereleases through v1.0.0-rc.8; no accepted RC and no stable v1.0.0 publication. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS., current_main_CI=Run 40505388775 exact 1d9357ee63b1066a891584a898842814de614fbf remains in progress in Node22/24 full CLI suites as of 2026-10-27 12:47 UTC; CodeQL 40505388849 SUCCESS, REDACTED SUCCESS exact main, release_blocker=exact-main behavioral CI failures on Node22 and Node24; awaiting workflow logs after terminal to identify cases and classify, PR128=candidate 8e114e2 based on 7952fac; independent review ACCEPT; no push/tests until main failure is triaged and exact main source suite passes, pr139=MERGED; exact PR CI39721786589 and CodeQL39721786428 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge CI39725081299 and CodeQL39725081349 in progress, runtime_policy_conflict=Awaiting user choice: merged DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure vs later relayed no-EOL-runtime mandate and draft PR137 >=22; do not alter runtime floor until resolved, pr128_head=8b585b5aa0223dcd2cd8f2bd90cb27c858dd66d3 pushed normal fast-forward after main CI; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39728018027 running Node20/22/24; CodeQL39728018086 SUCCESS, suite_claim=Released after E3 run; no local probes active., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, pr128=merged at ae54328; exact CI and CodeQL passed, pr125=merged at 8935918; exact candidate e4c91d7 review accepted; all six checks passed; prior lockfile finding fixed, post_merge_main=Exact main05994a4 CI40171717813 remains in Node22/24 npm CLI suites; CodeQL40171717805 SUCCESS., runtime_policy=Node >=20 vs >=22 decision remains pending direct user choice; official Node Release WG schedule confirms Node 20 EOL 2026-04-30. Affected README/DEVELOPMENT/quickstart files still claimed by Claude node22-floor; no edits without handoff., heldout_public_manifest=origin/main 8935918455a7fcc9434762712528c1169ec4ff63: eval/heldout-manifest.json SHA-256 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b; public metadata declares 40 tasks, 10 each across bugfix/debug/feature/refactor and Go/JavaScript/Python/Rust; PR16 merged f7769031cd8c2ccf281b5e930348889e9be7fa66; no custody acceptance inferred, no private payload read, main_CI=Exact main b73b6ec postmerge CI40327501470 terminal SUCCESS: Node22, Node24, Linux x86_64; CodeQL40327501389 SUCCESS., host_preflight=Committed synthetic-only current-source host preflight evidence at 0fea6a62ce26e0d5a9646d1fcd2249af1f7e69e7, on mike-dev boot 8928bf1f-8ae0-441b-8070-f05ef8823a5e; 10/10 pass, all 5 evidence files checksummed, independent ACCEPT; no held-out data/custodian store accessed; owner push/PR required. This does not close issue49 because custody/manifest compatibility acceptance rem…1928 tokens truncated…s. Both claims released at 2026-10-23T00:08:45Z; branch/worktree retained for integration., node22_focused_test=On combined candidate 81f4c8a8911e057470aad9b71210b9a1619c64b7, `npm ci --prefix cli` PASS and `node --import tsx --test test/node_floor.test.ts` from cli/ PASS 6/6 under isolated HOME, Node24.11.1/npm10.8.2; diff-check clean. Initial incorrect root loader invocation failed before tests and is recorded as invocation error., pr148_linux_job=PR148 CI run39829432189 Node20/22/24 matrices all SUCCESS; CodeQL run39829432308 SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 job120010039920 remains in apt-get update/install step, no failure conclusion. SUITE still held., node22_candidate_latest=Final ledger follow-up head c638da0dbf6c3cc42069b3bce02b0f679eba4a90 pushed. It updates stale REQ-REL-003 evidence to exact runtime source candidate 7c46a6d (Node22,24,linux CI39866110578 and CodeQL39866110533 passed) while preserving partial status solely for installed-RC E2. Clean detached check_requirements --enforce at c638da0 PASS: 123 rows,108 tested,6 partial,2 implemented,7 open,12 exact-RC deferrals; isolated HOME/XDG. Independent reviewer ACCEPT exact c638da0. PR current exact CI39870175272 and CodeQL39870175275 in progress; old 9ea run39869645611 cancelled as superseded. PR150 remains draft., node22_candidate_review=Fresh independent ACCEPT by plan05_readonly_review at exact HEAD b7601266bce9b08b4a4fd4adac805d8285c7e2d5 against 6e7bf0b. Review confirms Node floor/docs/workflows consistency, statuses remain partial, historical PR137 evidence is clearly separated, and no thresholds weakened., pr148_latest=Run39829432189 exact head 2ac1bf6265f8b715ca58a7638f30611496c693b7 remains IN_PROGRESS at Linux job120010039920 apt-get step (started 18:30:09Z), polled 18:58:32Z. Node matrices and CodeQL passed. Keep SUITE exclusive; no restart/cancel., heldout_latest=At main@bbafae, Issue #1 has no custodian/author response or active custody claim. T2/T3 public manifest hashes unchanged; evaluator still rejects legacy hidden.command and requires custodian conversion/replacement and repeated custody checks. No payload accessed., candidate_branch=origin/v1/node22-floor-converged@b7601266bce9b08b4a4fd4adac805d8285c7e2d5; exact base 6e7bf0b04752986ae4dde4bbe77ae76926aa9f06; independent reviewer plan05_readonly_review ACCEPT; requirement rows remain partial; focused tests 6/6; requirements gate fails only the two expected rows. No PR created due active SUITE., heldout_update=Public issue #1 refreshed 2026-10-22T18:57Z; no custodian response or handoff since comment #6345644084 (16:19Z); T2 sealed 40-task identity unchanged and incompatible with current blackbox-v1 qualification validator; no qualification run. Independent reviewer confirms synthetic-only adapter work can be done, but compatibility acceptance requires custodian., t3_symlink_remediation_design=Independent read-only reviewer recommends openat2/dirfd no-symlink resolution for T3 workspace facts/preconditions; read compaction metadata through no-follow bounded traversal or isolated read-only namespace; run post-agent command constraints on a freshly staged harness-owned copy, not live workspace. Synthetic regressions should cover file leaf/parent symlinks and sessions/tasks/history symlinks. No implementation yet; wait for PR148 exclusive SUITE claim to release., pr149=MERGED 2026-10-22T21:25:00Z at fe4f53e50948ce91822157087c99843ecbdee776; exact head 1972adb8a6d4b9bacf9974f33974b61d751de8ab CI Node20/22/24/Linux SUCCESS, CodeQL SUCCESS, independent ACCEPT; exact post-merge main CI 39857079093 and CodeQL 39857079216 running, pr150=Draft PR #150 head f0fef5806658b3821c903a2949727d42eb370121 based on 269d611; run39856838877 CANCELLED after base advanced; CodeQL SUCCESS; refresh after main post-merge CI terminal., doctor_diagnostics=Independent source review at exact main fe4f53e confirmed D1 event-loop blocking by synchronous state scan, D2 false positives for sessions/index.json and schema-2 task messageLog, D3 false fail for models absent from GET /models (live alias acceptance remains unverified), and overbroad .tmp interrupted-write label. Active implementation slice DOCTOR_DIAGNOSTICS handed to /root/acceptance_stage_clarification at branch v1/doctor-diagnostics, worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/doctor-diagnostics, base fe4f53e; focused synthetic tests only, no credentials/user data/inference, no full suite., main_post_pr149=Run39857079093 on exact main fe4f53e COMPLETED SUCCESS: Node20/22/24, Linux packaging/repro/smoke/install/security/requirements and source build gates all passed; CodeQL39857079216 SUCCESS., checkpoint_choices=Independent review confirmed five-choice prompt on normal interactive TUI at main 269d611; RC1 install lacks the feature; REPL fallback remains outside the implemented path and will be assessed after current release slices., doctor_pr=PR #151 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/151, head 673899fa611c261232abcc3149ab84cade921c95, base main fe4f53e50948ce91822157087c99843ecbdee776. Independent review ACCEPT exact head. Focused tests 5/5/build/diff-check PASS. Exact PR CI queued: run 39859201869 Node20/22/24, CodeQL 39859202021; no result yet. DOCTOR_DIAGNOSTICS and both file claims released by implementer at 21:40:11Z; /root claimed integration lane and pushed branch/opened PR., main_CI_update=Run39857079093 exact fe4f53e still running full npm CLI tests in Node20/22/24; all setup, build/version/requirements, Rust tests/build passed; run39857079216 CodeQL SUCCESS. Do not treat source as fully green until CLI suites terminal., rc1_checkpoint_failure=Reconfirmed current exact state 2026-10-23 04:18 UTC: immutable RC1 cb364c3 and RC2 19d6f0a both predate PR153 checkpoint-choice fix. Current main 1a484c3 and RC3 candidate 05acd5ab include merge 429bd31. Interactive TUI and REPL paths offer five explicit choices, including no-checkpoint configured-mode continuation and user-authorized sensitive checkpoint; no silent downgrade. Tests exist in repl_checkpoint_choices.test.ts and sidecar.test.ts. Exact PR156 CI39899212000 and RC157 CI39899241538 are both actively executing full CLI tests; CodeQL and JS/TS pass. No installed RC qualification yet. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS., pr151_ci=PR #151 exact head 673899fa checks: CodeQL PASS; Node20/22/24 pending. Exact base main run39857079093: Node20/22/24 suites SUCCESS; Linux packaging job active; CodeQL39857079216 SUCCESS., pr151_latest=At latest poll, exact PR workflow 39859201869 jobs Node20/22/24 are all executing npm --prefix cli test; CodeQL run39859202021 PASS. Main exact fe4f53e workflow39857079093 Node20/22/24 all SUCCESS; Linux package/repro job still running its npm CLI test step after Rust tests/build pass; CodeQL39857079216 SUCCESS., pr151_current=Exact PR head 673899fa611c261232abcc3149ab84cade921c95: CodeQL and Node20/22/24 pass; Linux package lane still in full npm CLI suite; base exact main fe4f53e full CI + CodeQL terminal SUCCESS., rc_tags_current=Remote tags verified: v1.0.0-rc.1 derefs cb364c386c42faa53b67e04cacc81d7e01520779; v1.0.0-rc.2 derefs 19d6f0a80e21f9b640a46ee12200c4f5f6d967a4. GitHub release list has RC1 prerelease only; no RC2 release. Checkpoint-choice commit 0bd67d9 is not ancestor of either tag and is ancestor of current main fe4f53e. RC2 tag is immutable and cannot be repurposed; next new candidate must use rc3. Current installed nexus is RC1 and reproduces operator-reported failure by exact artifact identity., heldout_compatibility=At exact main fe4f53e, public evaluator contract rejects legacy hidden.command/dir for qualification and docs require custodian-led conversion/replacement, repeat custody checks, and new immutable manifest identity (eval/README.md 163-169; eval/validate.mjs 39-48; eval/run.mjs 642). Public-only auditor found no semantics-preserving generic mapping to blackbox-v1; existing synthetic tests cover fail-closed rejection. No heldout content accessed. Posted metadata-only focused question to Issue #1 at 2026-10-22 22:09 UTC (comment 6352385428) asking lossless-mapping feasibility or replacement status/ETA., node22_next=Monitor exact c638da0 CI/CodeQL. If all pass, mark PR150 ready and integrate only under current protected rules and after checking main/base state. Verify postmerge CI/CodeQL and exact source gate. Then continue RC construction and qualification; external custody, installed-RC and human acceptance gates remain blockers., node22_status=doing, latest_main_ci=40117358437 on 676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef Node22 SUCCESS; Node24 IN_PROGRESS; CodeQL40117358496 SUCCESS, pr150_latest=Open draft PR #150 head 7c46a6d52095588f48579d9a96c5b2d526bdb3d9 based on exact main a4a7edd; run 39866110578 current, Node22/24 in prog