{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T20:12:20.663Z","ordinal":426553,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8e363721-8e5b-4c30-845c-cc400a11f8c4","process_id":"32688","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 log --oneline --graph -6; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show --stat --oneline HEAD; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show --format= -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | tail -n 65; gh pr view 268 --json reviews --jq '.reviews|map({author:.author.login,state:.state,submittedAt:.submittedAt,body:.body})' | head -c 1300"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 log --oneline --graph -6; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show --stat --oneline HEAD; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-readiness-20261027 show --format= -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | tail -n 65; gh pr view 268 --json reviews --jq '.reviews|map({author:.author.login,state:.state,submittedAt:.submittedAt,body:.body})' | head -c 1300"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"* 9ee2eb56 docs(release): refresh RC10 readiness checkpoint\n* eac6cdb4 docs(release): correct current readiness checkpoint\n* 005cd78c docs(release): refresh RC10 convergence checkpoint\n*   9c153d98 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into v1/rc10-readiness-20261027\n|\\  \n| *   fc582c66 Merge pull request #279 from mikeholownych/v1/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027\n| |\\  \n| | * a27b0d7c fix(checkpoint): fail closed on configured hook races\n9ee2eb56 docs(release): refresh RC10 readiness checkpoint\n docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 4 ++--\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex 130d71bf..91d38ddc 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 19:12 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 19:22 UTC)\n \n **Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540`, merging PR #279 after #278 and #277. Post-merge CI [40566591904](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591904) is running Node 22 and Node 24 on that exact SHA; CodeQL [40566591883](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591883) passed. Exact-main CI and CodeQL also passed on parent `cf05322` (runs [40561348972](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348972) and [40561348985](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348985)). Source requirements and RC10 version-sync checks passed on `cf05322` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification). These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\n \n-**Readiness PR #268:** At 19:12 UTC, its remote head was `9c153d984ff92eaafa413564ec2401a2a22ecb13`, based on `main@fc582c66`. Node 22/24 CI was queued and CodeQL had started; prior head `398a0ba` passed Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL, with Linux packaging still running. Those checks do not qualify the new merged-base head. This checkpoint update advances PR #268 again; its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n+**Readiness PR #268:** At 19:22 UTC, its remote head was `eac6cdb452726368d37a8ca373b56c688e0274da`, based on `main@fc582c66`. JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed on this exact head; Node 22 and Node 24 were still running. The preceding head `9c153d9` had not completed Node 22/24 at the last observation; its JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks passed. No independent review is recorded on `eac6cdb`. This checkpoint update advances PR #268 again; its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n \n **Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) corrected the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by #277. It merged at `fc582c6` after exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent read-only review passed. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; its checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. That provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only. Open PR [#280](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/280) addresses configured state-directory recovery; Node 22/24 are running, while JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass. Open PR [#281](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281) records RC10 cross-runner reproducibility; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass, while Node 22/24 are running. These PRs do not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix or release acceptance.\n \n[]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":533421189}},"started_at_ms":1793131940126,"completed_at_ms":1793131940660}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T20:12:21.740Z","ordinal":426554,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17efe-0f6b-7241-b494-4046d25c055e","call_id":"call_1ebd56571b14426a80531a4b7fa549dd","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"* 9ee2eb56 docs(release): refresh RC10 readiness checkpoint\n* eac6cdb4 docs(release): correct current readiness checkpoint\n* 005cd78c docs(release): refresh RC10 convergence checkpoint\n*   9c153d98 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into v1/rc10-readiness-20261027\n|\\  \n| *   fc582c66 Merge pull request #279 from mikeholownych/v1/configured-hook-race-retention-errors-20261027\n| |\\  \n| | * a27b0d7c fix(checkpoint): fail closed on configured hook races\n9ee2eb56 docs(release): refresh RC10 readiness checkpoint\n docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 4 ++--\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex 130d71bf..91d38ddc 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 19:12 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 19:22 UTC)\n \n **Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540`, merging PR #279 after #278 and #277. Post-merge CI [40566591904](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591904) is running Node 22 and Node 24 on that exact SHA; CodeQL [40566591883](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591883) passed. Exact-main CI and CodeQL also passed on parent `cf05322` (runs [40561348972](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348972) and [40561348985](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348985)). Source requirements and RC10 version-sync checks passed on `cf05322` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification). These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\n \n-**Readiness PR #268:** At 19:12 UTC, its remote head was `9c153d984ff92eaafa413564ec2401a2a22ecb13`, based on `main@fc582c66`. Node 22/24 CI was queued and CodeQL had started; prior head `398a0ba` passed Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL, with Linux packaging still running. Those checks do not qualify the new merged-base head. This checkpoint update advances PR #268 again; its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n+**Readiness PR #268:** At 19:22 UTC, its remote head was `eac6cdb452726368d37a8ca373b56c688e0274da`, based on `main@fc582c66`. JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed on this exact head; Node 22 and Node 24 were still running. The preceding head `9c153d9` had not completed Node 22/24 at the last observation; its JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks passed. No independent review is recorded on `eac6cdb`. This checkpoint update advances PR #268 again; its resulting head requires exact-head checks and independent review before merge.\n \n **Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) corrected the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by #277. It merged at `fc582c6` after exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent read-only review passed. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; its checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. That provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only. Open PR [#280](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/280) addresses configured state-directory recovery; Node 22/24 are running, while JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass. Open PR [#281](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281) records RC10 cross-runner reproducibility; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass, while Node 22/24 are running. These PRs do not establish the remaining provider/standalone matrix or release acceptance.\n \n[]\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","create_time":1793131941.7399309}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
