{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T20:59:32.482Z","ordinal":427331,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae110b3ce6881a0b4e77d977ce1c6c5","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The new PR #283 review found the matrix’s “upgrade” cell only reruns the installer, so it does not exercise `nexus upgrade` or PR #280’s recovery path. I’ve asked the active owner for a safe-boundary status/transfer; I’m keeping their claim intact and tracking this evidence as unaccepted. Main’s Node 24 CI is green; Node 22 CLI tests continue."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793134771870,"completed_at_ms":1793134772482}}
