{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T21:03:23.164Z","ordinal":427389,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae1119acbc481a0bcfa57bfe76e52a0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ll add these to the v1.0.0 scope and reconcile them against the current code and requirements before changing anything. I’ll keep the shared dirty checkout untouched, check ownership for the affected modules, and turn each item into a testable acceptance criterion so the refactors don’t weaken existing behavior."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793135002886,"completed_at_ms":1793135003164}}
