{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T21:03:51.204Z","ordinal":427407,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae111b6bf0081a0bc936a940a56217b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ll reconcile these additions against the current release plan and code, then take a concrete unclaimed slice through the repository’s normal worktree and claim process. I’ll preserve existing behavior and keep source-gate evidence distinct from RC qualification."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793135030791,"completed_at_ms":1793135031204}}
