e waiting preserves the work (1.905273ms)\n✔ parking and continuing independent work (39.681179ms)\n▶ durable waiting across process restart\n  ✔ 19. restart reconstructs the wake condition from durable state (246.312992ms)\n  ✔ 20. an overdue wake after restart re-evaluates immediately (359.733554ms)\n  ✔ 21. a future wake after restart is rescheduled for the remaining time (379.811414ms)\n✔ durable waiting across process restart (986.568371ms)\n▶ provider outage\n  ✔ 22. an endpoint outage reroutes to a qualified resource on another endpoint (2.088108ms)\n  ✔ 23. an outage parks the work when no alternate exists, and it resumes once a probe succeeds (1.657859ms)\n  ✔ 24. an outage of one endpoint coexists with independent work on another (2.404324ms)\n✔ provider outage (6.770338ms)\n▶ replay safety and non-temporary conditions\n  ✔ 25. UNKNOWN execution is never turned into a submission elsewhere (4.78463ms)\n  ✔ 26. auth and permanent failures are not temporary windows (2.088345ms)\n  ✔ 27. simultaneous conditions are tracked independently (0.671628ms)\n  ✔ 28. provider- and account-scope limits cover exactly that provider or credential (0.578027ms)\n  ✔ 29. a model-scope limit covers that model on every endpoint of the provider, and nothing else (0.379652ms)\n  ✔ 30. no busy loop: repeated failures back off and are bounded (3.44608ms)\n✔ replay safety and non-temporary conditions (12.517103ms)\n▶ compatibility and convergence\n  ✔ 31. unit agents are pinned to the resource and never admit more context than it serves (3.86241ms)\n  ✔ 32. durable state survives park, wait and resume (401.903209ms)\n  ✔ 33. completion still requires the original acceptance dependencies (4.273669ms)\n  ✔ 34. a genuine no-safe-transition blocks with one concrete decision instead of looping (1.621168ms)\n✔ compatibility and convergence (412.179666ms)\n▶ provider catalog enrichment (optional)\n  ✔ gateway /v1/models metadata adds capabilities, context and pool; no serving capacity park