r active temp files interrupted (84.714457ms)\n  ✔ state integrity directory traversal is asynchronous and leaves other event-loop work responsive (109.847424ms)\n  ✔ state integrity stats large task directories in bounded concurrent batches (1342.032778ms)\n  ✔ default state integrity has a bounded extended deadline for slow long-lived stores (5280.801776ms)\n  ✔ an explicit timeout still bounds the …594 tokens truncated… the session context diagnoses the session's own configuration (104.501388ms)\n✔ entry points share one engine (6202.814581ms)\n▶ SPEC-06 PR-6d requirements (ACC-PKG-06..09, REQ-DX-101..104)\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-06 (REQ-DX-101): doctor stderr is empty on a healthy run (no MaxListenersExceededWarning) (621.224572ms)\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-07 (REQ-DX-101): packaged doctor remedies contain no make or harness.sh (675.792851ms)\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-08 (REQ-DX-102): config.env at 0644 gives a warning and repair; --fix --yes sets 0600 (247.605287ms)\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-09 (REQ-DX-103): workspace path with a UUID segment appears unredacted in doctor output (81.044736ms)\n  ✔ REQ-DX-104: tui.launch verifies launchability via nexus-tui --live --check (91.714485ms)\n✔ SPEC-06 PR-6d requirements (ACC-PKG-06..09, REQ-DX-101..104) (1718.552936ms)\n✔ runAsAclArgs scopes evaluator and operator permissions with directory defaults (27.425401ms)\n✔ configured Go toolchain takes precedence over the host fallback (1.811422ms)\n✔ asUserSpec preserves timeout metadata and isolated processes reject missing timeouts (17.990058ms)\n✔ test infrastructure is recognised across Python, Go, JS/TS and Rust layouts (11.954427ms)\n✔ hidden test staging preserves workspace files and mounts only copied hidden files (10.836309ms)\n✔ Python oracle preload keeps saved source out of module globals and sys.path (98.454836ms)\n✔ pytest candidate imports cannot inspect hidden Python sources (1271.12766ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (8.246921ms)\n✔ only the agent's source ch