{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T22:49:52.545Z","ordinal":429448,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17f8e-44a1-7a61-b561-1498b7da4608","call_id":"call_a04d3465f3a44c118df3064952bda000","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** for evidence file SHA-256 `8fa49c2369f42f2f09707bc1f21a60f515501d30222939925731afc80bfec7cc`.\\n\\nThe three archived receipts match the check IDs and usage summaries, identify the RC10 ChatGPT provider calls, and contain no credential values or workspace content. The evidence satisfies the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row while keeping its claim limited to that provider gate. No provider tests were run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since `2026-10-26T12:18:17Z`, Issue #1 gained coordinator comments #6415806863 and #6423073471. The issue was last updated at `2026-10-26T17:37:53Z`; all 22 comments are from the coordinator, with no custodian response or handoff. The claims search also shows no active custodian/author claim.\\n\\nAt current `origin/main@303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`, the evaluator still rejects legacy `hidden.command` for qualification (`eval/validate.mjs:49`); the README still requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeat custody checks, and a new manifest identity. The `2026-10-27T05:30:30Z` release-loop record reports RC10 published but still lists `blackbox_v1_custodian_sealing` as a blocker.\\n\\nNo private material was accessed.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — reviewed commit `9b5ecd45826c74d1b0b3af51bf8090785c644d00` against base `a33ee450bcb9fdea1c2a7c7f7e167483d85aa8f4`.\\n\\nThe extraction preserves the `operation.ts` exports, and `scheduler.ts` uses type-only imports, avoiding a runtime cycle. The generated-DAG test checks dependency ordering and convergence across 100 fixed seeds.\\n\\nDiff SHA-256: `3323c528351cca52db1f296866c566f327d0a7dae40d07e3efb17ece4ca9efe8`.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","create_time":1793141392.545055}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
