{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T23:23:33.759Z","ordinal":429981,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17ef2-de25-7482-bff6-192772052d26","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae13274f97c81a0b077ee4e1abc922d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The audit shows several of the suggestions are already covered on current `main`: full operation lifecycle integration scenarios exist, `DecisionRejected` is documented, and operator settings already have a centralized `~/.config/nexus/config.env`. The scheduler is now extracted and has generated invariant tests. The remaining concrete gaps are nine silent catches and no operator-configurable operation policy; the capability catalog remains 45 KB, and independent held-out custody is still separate from pilot/task coverage."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793143413005,"completed_at_ms":1793143413759}}
